Type Hierarchy Setup Guide | AI Agent Skill","zh":"zustand状态管理Setup Guide","ja":"zustandステート管理ベストプラクティス","ko":"zustand 상태 관리 튜토리얼","es":"Guía de Configuración de Zustand para Agentes de Intelige...","fr":"Guide de Configuration de Zustand pour les Outils d''Intel...","de":"Zustand-Konfigurationsleitfaden für KI-Entwickler","pt":"Guia de Configuração do Zustand para Gerenciamento de Estado","ru":"Настройка Zustand для управления состоянием - ИИ Агенты","ar":"دليل إعداد Zustand لإدارة الحالة - أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"description":{"en":"Discover how to implement Zustand''s action type hierarchy for efficient state management. Learn to optimize your workflow with public actions, internal actio...","zh":"了解zustand的Action Type Hierarchy和状态管理功能，实现优雅的前端开发，AIエージェント","ja":"zustandのAction Type Hierarchyとステート管理機能をマスターし、効率的なフロントエンド開発を実現する，AIエージェント","ko":"zustand의 액션 타입 계층과 상태 관리 기능을 익히고 효율적인 프론트엔드 개발을 구현하세요，AIツール","es":"Aprende a configurar Zustand para una gestión de estado eficiente en tus proyectos de desarrollo de inteligencia artificial","fr":"Découvrez comment configurer Zustand pour une gestion d''état efficace dans vos projets de développement d''outils d''intelligence artificielle","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Zustand für eine effiziente Zustandsverwaltung in Ihren KI-Entwicklungsprojekten konfigurieren","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o Zustand para gerenciamento de estado eficaz em suas aplicações. Descubra como otimizar a gestão de estado com o Zustand.","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить Zustand для эффективного управления состоянием в ваших приложениях. Откройте для себя, как оптимизировать управление состоянием с помо...","ar":"تعلم كيفية إعداد Zustand لإدارة الحالة الفعالة في تطبيقاتك. اكتشف كيفية تحسين إدارة الحالة باستخدام Zustand - أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"definition":{"en":"zustand is a state management system that utilizes an action type hierarchy, including public actions, internal actions, and dispatch methods, to manage application state.","zh":"zustand是一种JavaScript状态管理库，提供了Action Type Hierarchy和dispatch方法","ja":"zustandはJavaScriptのステート管理ライブラリで、Action Type Hierarchyとdispatchメソッドを提供します","ko":"zustand는 JavaScript 상태 관리 라이브러리로서 액션 타입 계층과 디스패치 메서드를 제공합니다","es":"Zustand es una biblioteca de gestión de estado que permite la gestión de acciones públicas y privadas","fr":"Zustand est une bibliothèque de gestion d''état qui permet la gestion d''actions publiques et privées","de":"Zustand ist eine Bibliothek für die Zustandsverwaltung, die die Verwaltung von öffentlichen und privaten Aktionen ermöglicht","pt":"O Zustand é uma biblioteca de gerenciamento de estado que utiliza uma hierarquia de ações para facilitar a gestão do estado.","ru":"Zustand - это библиотека управления состоянием, которая использует иерархию действий для упрощения управления состоянием.","ar":"Zustand هو مكتبة لإدارة الحالة تستخدم ترتيبا هرميا للأفعال لتسهيل إدارة الحالة."},"features":{"en":["Implements public actions for UI components with verb form naming (e.g., createTopic, sendMessage)","Supports internal actions with internal_ prefix (e.g., internal_createTopic) for core business logic implementation","Utilizes dispatch methods for optimistic updates, service calls, and error handling","Enforces separation of concerns with public and internal actions","Optimizes workflow orchestration with parameter validation and flow control"],"zh":["Action Type Hierarchy","Public Actions","Internal Actions","Dispatch Methods","状态管理功能","优雅的前端开发"],"ja":["Action Type Hierarchy","Public Actions","Internal Actions","Dispatch Methods","ステート管理機能","効率的なフロントエンド開発"],"ko":["액션 타입 계층","Public Actions","Internal Actions","Dispatch Methods","상태 관리 기능","효율적인 프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["Gestión de acciones públicas y privadas","Implementación de lógica de negocio con prefix ''internal_''","Orquestación de flujos y validación de parámetros","Actualizaciones optimistas y manejo de errores","Integración con interfaces de usuario"],"fr":["Gestion des actions publiques et privées","Implémentation de la logique métier avec le préfixe ''internal_''","Orchestration des flux et validation des paramètres","Mises à jour optimistes et gestion des erreurs","Intégration avec les interfaces utilisateur"],"de":["Verwaltung von öffentlichen und privaten Aktionen","Implementierung der Geschäftslogik mit Prefix ''internal_''","Orchestrierung von Fluss und Validierung von Parametern","Optimistische Updates und Fehlerbehandlung","Integration mit Benutzeroberflächen"],"pt":["Hierarquia de ações para gerenciamento de estado","Ações públicas para interfaces de UI","Ações internas para lógica de negócios","Métodos de dispatch para atualizações otimistas","Validação de parâmetros e orquestração de fluxo","Tratamento de erros e chamadas de serviço"],"ru":["Иерархия действий для управления состоянием","Публичные действия для интерфейсов пользователей","Внутренние действия для бизнес-логики","Методы отправки для оптимистических обновлений","Валидация параметров и оркестрация потока","Обработка ошибок и вызовы служб"],"ar":["ترتيب هرمي للأفعال لإدارة الحالة","أفعال عامة لواجهات المستخدم","أفعال داخلية للlogic التجارية","طرق الإرسال للتحديثات المثلى","تحقق من معاملات وتنسيق التدفق","معالجة الأخطاء و呼وف الخدمة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use zustand","zustand action type hierarchy","zustand vs mobx","zustand install guide","what is zustand","zustand alternative","zustand setup tutorial","zustand state management","zustand public actions","zustand internal actions"],"zh":["zustand","状态管理","Action Type Hierarchy","AIエージェント","前端开发","JavaScript","状态管理库","zustand教程","zustand文档"],"ja":["zustand","ステート管理","Action Type Hierarchy","AIエージェント","フロントエンド開発","JavaScript","ステート管理ライブラリ","zustandチュートリアル","zustandドキュメント"],"ko":["zustand","상태 관리","액션 타입 계층","AIツール","프론트엔드 개발","JavaScript","상태 관리 라이브러리","zustand 튜토리얼","zustand 문서"],"es":["zustand","gestión de estado","acciones públicas","acciones privadas","lógica de negocio","orquestación de flujos","validación de parámetros","actualizaciones optimistas","manejo de errores","agentes de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["zustand","gestion d''état","actions publiques","actions privées","logique métier","orchestration des flux","validation des paramètres","mises à jour optimistes","gestion des erreurs","outils d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["zustand","zustandsverwaltung","öffentliche aktionen","private aktionen","geschäftslogik","flussorchestrierung","parametervalidierung","optimistische updates","fehlerbehandlung","ki-entwicklung"],"pt":["zustand","gerenciamento de estado","hierarquia de ações","ações públicas","ações internas","métodos de dispatch","validação de parâmetros","orquestração de fluxo","tratamento de erros"],"ru":["zustand","управление состоянием","иерархия действий","публичные действия","внутренние действия","методы отправки","валидация параметров","оркестрация потока","обработка ошибок","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["zustand","إدارة الحالة","ترتيب هرمي للأفعال","أفعال عامة","أفعال داخلية","طرق الإرسال","تحقق من معاملات","تنسيق التدفق","معالجة الأخطاء","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Staysr","repo":"lobe-windos-build","repoPath":"Staysr/lobe-windos-build","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T01:34:35Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"zustand","description":"Zustand state management guide. Use when working with store code (src/store/**), implementing actions, managing state, or creating slices. Triggers on Zustand store development, state management questions, or action implementation.","bodyPreview":"# LobeHub Zustand State Management\n\n## Action Type Hierarchy\n\n### 1. Public Actions\n\nMain interfaces for UI components:\n\n- Naming: Verb form (`createTopic`, `sendMessage`)\n- Responsibilities: Parameter validation, flow orchestration\n\n### 2. Internal Actions (`internal_*`)\n\nCore business logic implementation:\n\n- Naming: `internal_` prefix (`internal_createTopic`)\n- Responsibilities: Optimistic updates, service calls, error handling\n- Should not be called directly by UI\n\n### 3. Dispatch Methods (`","body":"# LobeHub Zustand State Management\n\n## Action Type Hierarchy\n\n### 1. Public Actions\n\nMain interfaces for UI components:\n\n- Naming: Verb form (`createTopic`, `sendMessage`)\n- Responsibilities: Parameter validation, flow orchestration\n\n### 2. Internal Actions (`internal_*`)\n\nCore business logic implementation:\n\n- Naming: `internal_` prefix (`internal_createTopic`)\n- Responsibilities: Optimistic updates, service calls, error handling\n- Should not be called directly by UI\n\n### 3. Dispatch Methods (`internal_dispatch*`)\n\nState update handlers:\n\n- Naming: `internal_dispatch` + entity (`internal_dispatchTopic`)\n- Responsibilities: Calling reducers, updating store\n\n## When to Use Reducer vs Simple `set`\n\n**Use Reducer Pattern:**\n\n- Managing object lists/maps (`messagesMap`, `topicMaps`)\n- Optimistic updates\n- Complex state transitions\n\n**Use Simple `set`:**\n\n- Toggling booleans\n- Updating simple values\n- Setting single state fields\n\n## Optimistic Update Pattern\n\n```typescript\ninternal_createTopic: async (params) => {\n  const tmpId = Date.now().toString();\n\n  // 1. Immediately update frontend (optimistic)\n  get().internal_dispatchTopic(\n    { type: ''addTopic'', value: { ...params, id: tmpId } },\n    ''internal_createTopic''\n  );\n\n  // 2. Call backend service\n  const topicId = await topicService.createTopic(params);\n\n  // 3. Refresh for consistency\n  await get().refreshTopic();\n  return topicId;\n},\n```\n\n**Delete operations**: Don''t use optimistic updates (destructive, complex recovery)\n\n## Naming Conventions\n\n**Actions:**\n\n- Public: `createTopic`, `sendMessage`\n- Internal: `internal_createTopic`, `internal_updateMessageContent`\n- Dispatch: `internal_dispatchTopic`\n- Toggle: `internal_toggleMessageLoading`\n\n**State:**\n\n- ID arrays: `messageLoadingIds`, `topicEditingIds`\n- Maps: `topicMaps`, `messagesMap`\n- Active: `activeTopicId`\n- Init flags: `topicsInit`\n\n## Detailed Guides\n\n- Action patterns: `references/action-patterns.md`\n- Slice organization: `references/slice-organization.md`\n\n## Class-Based Action Implementation\n\nWe are migrating slices from plain `StateCreator` objects to **class-based actions**.\n\n### Pattern\n\n- Define a class that encapsulates actions and receives `(set, get, api)` in the constructor.\n- Use `#private` fields (e.g., `#set`, `#get`) to avoid leaking internals.\n- Prefer shared typing helpers:\n  - `StoreSetter<T>` from `@/store/types` for `set`.\n  - `Pick<ActionImpl, keyof ActionImpl>` to expose only public methods.\n- Export a `create*Slice` helper that returns a class instance.\n\n```ts\ntype Setter = StoreSetter<HomeStore>;\nexport const createRecentSlice = (set: Setter, get: () => HomeStore, _api?: unknown) =>\n  new RecentActionImpl(set, get, _api);\n\nexport class RecentActionImpl {\n  readonly #get: () => HomeStore;\n  readonly #set: Setter;\n\n  constructor(set: Setter, get: () => HomeStore, _api?: unknown) {\n    void _api;\n    this.#set = set;\n    this.#get = get;\n  }\n\n  useFetchRecentTopics = () => {\n    // ...\n  };\n}\n\nexport type RecentAction = Pick<RecentActionImpl, keyof RecentActionImpl>;\n```\n\n### Composition\n\n- In store files, merge class instances with `flattenActions` (do not spread class instances).\n- `flattenActions` binds methods to the original class instance and supports prototype methods and class fields.\n\n```ts\nconst createStore: StateCreator<HomeStore, [[''zustand/devtools'', never]]> = (...params) => ({\n  ...initialState,\n  ...flattenActions<HomeStoreAction>([\n    createRecentSlice(...params),\n    createHomeInputSlice(...params),\n  ]),\n});\n```\n\n### Multi-Class Slices\n\n- For large slices that need multiple action classes, compose them in the slice entry using `flattenActions`.\n- Use a local `PublicActions<T>` helper if you need to combine multiple classes and hide private fields.\n\n```ts\ntype PublicActions<T> = { [K in keyof T]: T[K] };\n\nexport type ChatGroupAction = PublicActions<\n  ChatGroupInternalAction & ChatGroupLifecycleAction & ChatGroupMemberAction & ChatGroupCurdAction\n>;\n\nexport const chatGroupAction: StateCreator<\n  ChatGroupStore,\n  [[''zustand/devtools'', never]],\n  [],\n  ChatGroupAction\n> = (...params) =>\n  flattenActions<ChatGroupAction>([\n    new ChatGroupInternalAction(...params),\n    new ChatGroupLifecycleAction(...params),\n    new ChatGroupMemberAction(...params),\n    new ChatGroupCurdAction(...params),\n  ]);\n```\n\n### Store-Access Types\n\n- For class methods that depend on actions in other classes, define explicit store augmentations:\n  - `ChatGroupStoreWithSwitchTopic` for lifecycle `switchTopic`\n  - `ChatGroupStoreWithRefresh` for member refresh\n  - `ChatGroupStoreWithInternal` for curd `internal_dispatchChatGroup`\n\n### Do / Don''t\n\n- **Do**: keep constructor signature aligned with `StateCreator` params `(set, get, api)`.\n- **Do**: use `#private` to avoid `set/get` being exposed.\n- **Do**: use `flattenActions` instead of spreading class instances.\n- **Don''t**: keep both old slice objects and class actions active at the same time.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T13:09:55.346Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced state management capabilities with hierarchical action structures.","zh":"非常适合需要高级状态管理能力的前端代理，具有层次化的动作结构。","ja":"階層構造を持つ高度な状態管理機能が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"계층적 액션 구조를 갖춘 고급 상태 관리 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de gestión de estado avanzadas con estructuras de acción jerárquicas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend nécessitant des capacités de gestion d''état avancées avec des structures d''action hiérarchiques.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Statusverwaltungsfunktionen mit hierarchischen Aktionsstrukturen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades de gerenciamento de estado avançadas com estruturas de ação hierárquicas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности управления состоянием с иерархической структурой действий.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات إدارة الحالة المتقدمة مع هياكل الإجراءات الهيئرارشية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage complex workflows using public actions, internal actions, and dispatch methods, while supporting optimistic updates, service calls, and error handling through libraries like Zustand.","zh":"赋予代理管理复杂工作流的能力，使用公共动作、内部动作和调度方法，同时支持通过类似Zustand的库进行乐观更新、服务调用和错误处理。","ja":"パブリックアクション、内部アクション、ディスパッチメソッドを使用して複雑なワークフローを管理し、Zustandなどのライブラリを介した楽観的な更新、サービス呼び出し、エラーハンドリングをサポートするエージェントを可能にします。","ko":"공개 액션, 내부 액션 및 디스패치 방법을 사용하여 복잡한 워크플ロー 관리를 가능하게 하며, Zustand와 같은 라이브러리를 통해 낙관적 업데이트, 서비스 호출 및 오류 처리를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar flujos de trabajo complejos utilizando acciones públicas, acciones internas y métodos de despacho, mientras que admite actualizaciones optimistas, llamadas de servicio y control de errores a través de bibliotecas como Zustand.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des flux de travail complexes en utilisant des actions publiques, des actions internes et des méthodes de dispatch, tout en prenant en charge les mises à jour optimistes, les appels de service et la gestion des erreurs via des bibliothèques comme Zustand.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, komplexe Workflows mit öffentlichen Aktionen, internen Aktionen und Dispatch-Methoden zu verwalten, während es optimistische Updates, Serviceaufrufe und Fehlerbehandlung über Bibliotheken wie Zustand unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar fluxos de trabalho complexos usando ações públicas, ações internas e métodos de despacho, ao mesmo tempo em que suporta atualizações otimistas, chamadas de serviço e tratamento de erros por meio de bibliotecas como Zustand.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять сложными рабочими процессами с помощью публичных действий, внутренних действий и методов отправки, а также поддерживает оптимистические обновления, вызовы служб и обработку ошибок через библиотеки như Zustand.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة سلاسل عمل معقدة باستخدام الإجراءات العامة والإجراءات الداخلية وطرق الإرسال، وفي نفس الوقت يدعم التحديثات المتفائلة ومكالمات الخدمة ومعالجة الأخطاء من خلال مكتبات مثل Zustand."},"useCases":{"en":["Orchestrating UI component interactions","Implementing core business logic with internal actions","Dispatching actions with parameter validation and flow orchestration"],"zh":["编排UI组件交互","使用内部动作实现核心业务逻辑","具有参数验证和流程编排的动作调度"],"ja":["UIコンポーネントの相互作用のオーケストレーション","内部アクションを使用したコアビジネスロジックの実装","パラメータ検証とフローオーケストレーションを伴うアクションのディスパッチ"],"ko":["UI 컴포넌트 상호 작용의 오케스트레이션","내부 액션을 사용한 핵심 비즈니스 논리의 구현","매개 변수 검증 및 흐름 오케스트레이션을 갖춘 액션 디스패치"],"es":["Orquestar interacciones de componentes de interfaz de usuario","Implementar lógica comercial básica con acciones internas","Dispatch de acciones con validación de parámetros y orquestación de flujo"],"fr":["Orchestrer les interactions des composants d''interface utilisateur","Mettre en œuvre la logique commerciale de base avec des actions internes","Dispatch d''actions avec validation de paramètres et orchestration de flux"],"de":["Orchestrieren von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten-Interaktionen","Implementieren von Kerngeschäftslogik mit internen Aktionen","Dispatch von Aktionen mit Parameterüberprüfung und Flussorchestrierung"],"pt":["Orquestração de interações de componentes de interface do usuário","Implementação de lógica de negócios principal com ações internas","Despacho de ações com validação de parâmetros e orquestração de fluxo"],"ru":["Оркестровка взаимодействия компонентов пользовательского интерфейса","Реализация основной бизнес-логики с помощью внутренних действий","Отправка действий с валидацией параметров и оркестровкой потока"],"ar":["توجيه تفاعلات مكونات واجهة المستخدم","تنفيذ المنطق التجاري الأساسي بإجراءات داخلية","إرسال الإجراءات بالتحقق من معاملات وتوجيه التدفق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Zustand state management system integration","Hierarchical action structure must be maintained"],"zh":["需要Zustand状态管理系统集成","必须维护层次化的动作结构"],"ja":["Zustand状態管理システムの統合が必要","階層構造のアクション構造が維持される必要がある"],"ko":["Zustand 상태 관리 시스템 통합이 필요함","계층적 액션 구조를 유지해야 함"],"es":["Requiere integración del sistema de gestión de estado Zustand","La estructura de acción jerárquica debe mantenerse"],"fr":["Nécessite l''intégration du système de gestion d''état Zustand","La structure d''action hiérarchique doit être maintenue"],"de":["Erfordert die Integration des Zustand-Statusverwaltungssystems","Die hierarchische Aktionsstruktur muss beibehalten werden"],"pt":["Requer integração do sistema de gerenciamento de estado Zustand","A estrutura de ação hierárquica deve ser mantida"],"ru":["Требует интеграции системы управления состоянием Zustand","Иерархическая структура действий должна быть сохранена"],"ar":["يتطلب دمج نظام Zustand لإدارة الحالة","يجب الحفاظ على هيكل الإجراءات الهيئرارشي"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"f14495ff461cc8bf3c69e46edf63fda621f71b8bdaaebcada97c595c4561a2a4","qualityScore":57}');
