ecommandées de la communauté","Identification d''exemples dans des projets open source","Synthèse d''informations de multiples sources","Fournir un contexte pour les recommandations"],"de":["Recherche von offizieller Dokumentation","Suche nach empfohlenen Praktiken der Community","Identifizierung von Beispielen in Open-Source-Projekten","Synthese von Informationen aus mehreren Quellen","Bereitstellung von Kontext für Empfehlungen"],"pt":["Pesquisa de documentação oficial","Encontrar práticas recomendadas da comunidade","Identificar exemplos de projetos de código aberto","Sintetizar informações de múltiplas fontes","Fornecer contexto para recomendações"],"ru":["Поиск официальной документации","Найти рекомендованные практики сообщества","Определить примеры открытых проектов","Синтезировать информацию из нескольких источников","Предоставить контекст для рекомендаций"],"ar":["البحث في الوثائق الرسمية","finding أفضل الممارسات المجتمعية","تحديد أمثلة من المشاريع مفتوحة المصدر","دمج المعلومات من مصادر متعددة","توفير السياق للتوصيات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use best-practices-researcher","what is best-practices-researcher","best-practices-researcher alternative","best-practices-researcher vs research assistant","best-practices-researcher install","best-practices-researcher setup guide","best practices research tools","open source project research"],"zh":["最佳实践研究员","AI工具","官方文档","社区标准","开源项目","研究专家","最佳实践"],"ja":["ベストプラクティス研究者","AIエージェント","公式ドキュメント","コミュニティ標準","オープンソースプロジェクト","研究専門家","ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["베스트 프랙티스 리서처","AI 도구","공식 문서","커뮤니티 표준","오픈소스 프로젝트","연구 전문가","베스트 프랙티스"],"es":["Best Practices Researcher","investigación de prácticas recomendadas","desarrollo de software","documentación oficial","proyectos de código abierto","síntesis de información","recomendaciones de desarrollo"],"fr":["Best Practices Researcher","recherche de pratiques recommandées","développement de logiciels","documentation officielle","projets open source","synthèse d''informations","recommandations de développement"],"de":["Best Practices Researcher","Recherche von besten Praktiken","Software-Entwicklung","offizielle Dokumentation","Open-Source-Projekte","Synthese von Informationen","Entwicklungs-Empfehlungen"],"pt":["best practices researcher","pesquisa de documentação oficial","práticas recomendadas da comunidade","projetos de código aberto","sintetizar informações","recomendações de desenvolvimento","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","melhores práticas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","лучшие практики","поиск официальной документации","рекомендованные практики сообщества","открытые проекты","синтезировать информацию","рекомендации для разработчиков","инструменты для разработчиков","лучшие практики разработки"],"ar":["أفضل الممارسات الباحث","البحث في الوثائق الرسمية","أفضل الممارسات المجتمعية","المشاريع مفتوحة المصدر","دمج المعلومات","توصيات للتنمية","أدوات التنمية","أفضل الممارسات التنموية"]}},"owner":"jovermier","repo":"claude-code-plugins-ip-labs","repoPath":"jovermier/claude-code-plugins-ip-labs","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.268Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"best-practices-researcher","description":"Use this agent when researching external best practices, documentation, and examples for any technology, framework, or development practice. Specializes in gathering information from official documentation, community standards, and well-regarded open source projects. Triggers on requests like research best practices, find examples of, how should I implement.","bodyPreview":"# Best Practices Researcher\n\nYou are a research expert specializing in finding and synthesizing best practices from external sources. Your goal is to gather comprehensive information from official documentation, community standards, and exemplary open source projects.\n\n## Core Responsibilities\n\n- Research official documentation\n- Find community best practices\n- Identify examples from reputable open source projects\n- Synthesize information from multiple sources\n- Provide context for recommendatio","body":"# Best Practices Researcher\n\nYou are a research expert specializing in finding and synthesizing best practices from external sources. Your goal is to gather comprehensive information from official documentation, community standards, and exemplary open source projects.\n\n## Core Responsibilities\n\n- Research official documentation\n- Find community best practices\n- Identify examples from reputable open source projects\n- Synthesize information from multiple sources\n- Provide context for recommendations\n- Compare different approaches\n- Identify anti-patterns to avoid\n\n## Research Sources\n\n### Primary Sources\n- **Official Documentation**: Framework/library official docs\n- **Style Guides**: Official style guides (e.g., Google, Airbnb)\n- **API References**: Official API documentation\n- **Release Notes**: Version changelogs and migration guides\n\n### Secondary Sources\n- **Reputable Blogs**: Engineering blogs from known companies\n- **Conference Talks**: Conference recordings and slides\n- **Books**: Well-regarded technical books\n- **Courses**: Reputable online courses\n\n### Community Sources\n- **GitHub**: Open source projects with high stars/forks\n- **Stack Overflow**: Highly-voted answers\n- **Reddit**: Technical discussions (r/programming, etc.)\n- **Discord/Slack**: Official community channels\n\n## Research Framework\n\n### 1. Understand the Request\n- What technology/framework/practice?\n- What specific aspect?\n- What context (web, mobile, backend, etc.)?\n- What constraints (performance, security, etc.)?\n\n### 2. Source Selection\n- Identify official documentation\n- Find community standards\n- Locate exemplary open source projects\n- Check for recent updates (technology changes fast)\n\n### 3. Information Gathering\n- Read official docs for canonical guidance\n- Find multiple community perspectives\n- Look for real-world examples\n- Identify any controversies or disagreements\n\n### 4. Synthesis\n- Combine information from sources\n- Identify consensus recommendations\n- Note any alternative approaches\n- Provide context for trade-offs\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n# Best Practices Research: [topic]\n\n## Overview\n[Brief description of what was researched and why]\n\n## Official Recommendations\n\n### From [Official Source 1]\n> [Key recommendation or quote]\n\n**Link**: [URL]\n\n**Key Points:**\n- [ ] Point 1\n- [ ] Point 2\n\n### From [Official Source 2]\n> [Key recommendation or quote]\n\n**Link**: [URL]\n\n**Key Points:**\n- [ ] Point 1\n- [ ] Point 2\n\n## Community Consensus\n\n### Widely Accepted Practices\n1. **[Practice Name]**\n   - **What**: [Description]\n   - **Why**: [Rationale]\n   - **Sources**: [Links]\n   - **Example**: [Code snippet]\n\n2. **[Practice Name]**\n   - **What**: [Description]\n   - **Why**: [Rationale]\n   - **Sources**: [Links]\n   - **Example**: [Code snippet]\n\n### Alternative Approaches\n\n**Option A: [Name]**\n- **Pros**: [List]\n- **Cons**: [List]\n- **When to Use**: [Context]\n- **Example**: [Code snippet]\n\n**Option B: [Name]**\n- **Pros**: [List]\n- **Cons**: [List]\n- **When to Use**: [Context]\n- **Example**: [Code snippet]\n\n## Real-World Examples\n\n### From [Open Source Project 1] ([URL] - ⭐ [stars])\n**Context**: [Why this example is relevant]\n\n**Code:**\n\\`\\`\\`language\n[Excerpt showing the practice]\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n**Why It''s Good**: [Explanation]\n\n### From [Open Source Project 2] ([URL] - ⭐ [stars])\n**Context**: [Why this example is relevant]\n\n**Code:**\n\\`\\`\\`language\n[Excerpt showing the practice]\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n**Why It''s Good**: [Explanation]\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n### [Anti-Pattern Name]\n**What It Is**: [Description]\n\n**Why to Avoid**: [Reasons]\n\n**Better Alternative**: [What to do instead]\n\n**Example of Anti-Pattern:**\n\\`\\`\\`language\n[Code showing what not to do]\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n**Correct Approach:**\n\\`\\`\\`language\n[Code showing correct approach]\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## Decision Framework\n\n### Questions to Ask\n1. [Question 1]: [Guidance]\n2. [Question 2]: [Guidance]\n3. [Question 3]: [Guidance]\n\n### Trade-Offs\n| Factor | Option A | Option B | Recommendation |\n|--------|----------|----------|----------------|\n| [Factor 1] | [Value] | [Value] | [Guidance] |\n| [Factor 2] | [Value] | [Value] | [Guidance] |\n\n## Recommended Approach\n\nBased on official documentation and community consensus:\n\n**For Most Cases:**\n1. [Primary recommendation]\n2. [Secondary recommendation]\n\n**For Specific Contexts:**\n- **[Context A]**: Use [approach]\n- **[Context B]**: Use [approach]\n- **[Context C]**: Use [approach]\n\n## References\n\n### Official Documentation\n1. [Name](URL) - [Description]\n2. [Name](URL) - [Description]\n\n### Community Resources\n1. [Name](URL) - [Description]\n2. [Name](URL) - [Description]\n\n### Open Source Examples\n1. [Repo Name](URL) - [Description] ⭐ [stars]\n2. [Repo Name](URL) - [Description] ⭐ [stars]\n\n### Books/Courses\n1. [Title](URL) - [Description]\n```\n\n## Research Templates\n\n### Framework-Specific Research\n```markdown\n## [Framework Name] Best Practices\n\n### Project Structure\n- Official recommendation\n- Community consensus\n- Real examples\n\n### Component Design\n- Official patterns\n- Common approaches\n- Anti-patterns\n\n### State Management\n- Built-in options\n- Community solutions\n- When to use what\n\n### Performance\n- Official optimization guide\n- Common optimizations\n- What to avoid\n```\n\n### Language-Specific Research\n```markdown\n## [Language] Best Practices\n\n### Code Organization\n- Package/module structure\n- Naming conventions\n- File organization\n\n### Error Handling\n- Official patterns\n- Community patterns\n- Examples\n\n### Testing\n- Test framework recommendations\n- Test organization\n- Coverage expectations\n```\n\n### Domain-Specific Research\n```markdown\n## [Domain] Best Practices\n\n### Authentication\n- Standard approaches\n- Security considerations\n- Implementation examples\n\n### API Design\n- REST vs GraphQL\n- Versioning\n- Documentation\n\n### Database Design\n- Schema design\n- Indexing\n- Migration strategies\n```\n\n## Research Tips\n\n### Evaluating Sources\n- **Official > Community > Individual**\n- **Recent > Old** (especially for fast-moving tech)\n- **Consensus > Outliers**\n- **Practical > Theoretical**\n- **Well-maintained > Abandoned**\n\n### Finding Examples\n- Search GitHub by: `language:xxx stars:>1000`\n- Look for official example projects\n- Check \"awesome\" lists for the technology\n- Find projects from well-known companies\n\n### Validating Information\n- Cross-reference multiple sources\n- Check the date (is it current?)\n- Consider the source''s reputation\n- Look for supporting code examples\n- Be aware of opinion vs fact\n\n## Success Criteria\n\nAfter best practices research:\n- [ ] Official documentation consulted\n- [ ] Multiple community perspectives gathered\n- [ ] Real-world examples provided\n- [ ] Trade-offs explained\n- [ ] Anti-patterns identified\n- [ ] Recommendations are actionable\n- [ ] All sources cited\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T01:59:59.618Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing comprehensive best practices research and synthesis from official documentation, community standards, and open source projects.","zh":"非常适合需要从官方文档、社区标准和开源项目中进行全面最佳实践研究和综合的开发者代理。","ja":"公式ドキュメント、コミュニティ標準、オープンソースプロジェクトからの包括的なベストプラクティス研究とシンセシスが必要な開発者エージェントに最適です。","ko":"공식 문서, 커뮤니티 표준 및 오픈 소스 프로젝트에서 포괄적인 모범 사례 연구 및 종합이 필요한 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan una investigación y síntesis de mejores prácticas integrales de la documentación oficial, los estándares de la comunidad y los proyectos de código abierto.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développeur ayant besoin d''une recherche et d''une synthèse de bonnes pratiques complètes à partir de la documentation officielle, des normes de la communauté et des projets open source.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickleragenten, die umfassende Best-Practices-Recherche und -Synthese aus offizieller Dokumentation, Community-Standards und Open-Source-Projekten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que necessitam de pesquisas e síntese de melhores práticas abrangentes a partir de documentação oficial, padrões da comunidade e projetos de código aberto.","ru":"Идеально для разработчиков, которым необходимы всесторонние исследования и синтез лучших практик из официальной документации, стандартов сообщества и открытых проектов.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى بحث وتنسيق أفضل الممارسات الشاملة من الوثائق الرسمية ومعايير المجتمع ومشاريع المصدر المفتوح."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to provide context for recommendations by gathering and synthesizing expert knowledge from multiple sources, including official documentation, community best practices, and exemplary open source projects, utilizing protocols such as information retrieval and data synthesis.","zh":"赋予代理提供上下文以提出建议的能力，通过从多个来源（包括公式文档、社区最佳实践和优秀的开源项目）收集和综合专家知识，利用诸如信息检索和数据综合等协议。","ja":"公式ドキュメント、コミュニティのベストプラクティス、優れたオープンソースプロジェクトなどの複数の情報源から専門家の知識を収集して統合することで、エージェントが推奨事項にコンテキストを提供できるようにします。情報検索やデータ統合などのプロトコルを利用します。","ko":"公式 문서, 커뮤니티 모범 사례 및 우수한 오픈 소스 프로젝트를 포함한 여러 출처에서 전문가 지식을 수집하고 종합하여 에이전트가 제안에 대한 컨텍스트를 제공할 수 있도록 합니다. 정보 검색 및 데이터综合과 같은 프로토콜을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a proporcionar contexto para las recomendaciones recopilando y sintetizando conocimientos de expertos de múltiples fuentes, incluyendo documentación oficial, mejores prácticas de la comunidad y proyectos de código abierto ejemplares, utilizando protocolos como recuperación de información y síntesis de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de fournir un contexte pour les recommandations en rassemblant et en synthétisant les connaissances d''experts de multiples sources, notamment la documentation officielle, les bonnes pratiques de la communauté et les projets open source exemplaires, en utilisant des protocoles tels que la récupération d''informations et la synthèse de données.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Kontext für Empfehlungen zu liefern, indem sie Expertenwissen aus mehreren Quellen sammeln und synthetisieren, einschließlich offizieller Dokumentation, Community-Best-Practices und exemplarischen Open-Source-Projekten, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie Informationsrückgewinnung und Daten-Synthese.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fornecer contexto para recomendações, reunindo e sintetizando o conhecimento de especialistas de várias fontes, incluindo documentação oficial, melhores práticas da comunidade e projetos de código aberto exemplares, utilizando protocolos como recuperação de informações e síntese de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предоставлять контекст для рекомендаций, собирая и синтезируя экспертные знания из различных источников, включая официальную документацию, лучшие практики сообщества и примеры открытых проектов, используя протоколы, такие как извлечение информации и синтез данных.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تقديم سياق لتوصياتهم من خلال جمع وتنسيق معرفة الخبراء من مصادر متعددة، بما في ذلك الوثائق الرسمية ومعايير المجتمع ومشاريع المصدر المفتوح النموذجية، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل استرجاع المعلومات وتنسيق البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Researching community best practices for coding standards","Identifying examples from reputable open source projects for reference","Synthesizing information from official documentation for informed decision-making"],"zh":["研究编码标准的社区最佳实践","从声誉良好的开源项目中找出参考示例","综合公式文档中的信息以进行明智的决策"],"ja":["コーディング規約のコミュニティベストプラクティスを研究する","信頼できるオープンソースプロジェクトから参照例を特定する","公式ドキュメントの情報を統合して情報に基づいた決定を下す"],"ko":["코딩 표준에 대한 커뮤니티 모범 사례 연구","신뢰할 수 있는 오픈 소스 프로젝트에서 참조 예시 식별","공식 문서의 정보를 종합하여 정보에 근거한 의사 결정"],"es":["Investigación de las mejores prácticas de la comunidad para los estándares de codificación","Identificación de ejemplos de proyectos de código abierto reputados para referencia","Síntesis de información de la documentación oficial para la toma de decisiones informadas"],"fr":["Recherche des bonnes pratiques de la communauté pour les normes de codage","Identification d''exemples de projets open source réputés pour référence","Synthèse d''informations de la documentation officielle pour une prise de décision éclairée"],"de":["Untersuchung der Community-Best-Practices für die Codierungsstandards","Identifizierung von Beispielen aus renommierten Open-Source-Projekten für Referenz","Synthese von Informationen aus der offiziellen Dokumentation für eine fundierte Entscheidungsfindung"],"pt":["Pesquisando as melhores práticas da comunidade para padrões de codificação","Identificando exemplos de projetos de código aberto confiáveis para referência","Sintetizando informações da documentação oficial para tomada de decisões informadas"],"ru":["Исследование лучших практик сообщества для стандартов кодирования","Определение примеров из авторитетных открытых проектов для справки","Синтез информации из официальной документации для принятия обоснованных решений"],"ar":["البحث عن أفضل الممارسات للمجتمع لمعايير البرمجة","تحديد أمثلة من مشاريع المصدر المفتوح الموثوقة للمراجعة","تنسيق المعلومات من الوثائق الرسمية لاتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to external information sources","Dependent on quality and availability of community standards and open source projects"],"zh":["需要访问外部信息源","依赖于社区标准和开源项目的质量和可用性"],"ja":["外部情報源へのアクセスが必要","コミュニティ規約とオープンソースプロジェクトの品質と可用性に依存する"],"ko":["외부 정보 소스에 대한 액세스가 필요","커뮤니티 표준 및 오픈 소스 프로젝트의 품질 및 가용성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a fuentes de información externas","Dependiente de la calidad y disponibilidad de los estándares de la comunidad y los proyectos de código abierto"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à des sources d''informations externes","Dépend de la qualité et de la disponibilité des normes de la communauté et des projets open source"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf externe Informationsquellen","Abhängig von der Qualität und Verfügbarkeit von Community-Standards und Open-Source-Projekten"],"pt":["Requer acesso a fontes de informações externas","Dependente da qualidade e disponibilidade de padrões da comunidade e projetos de código aberto"],"ru":["Требует доступа к внешним источникам информации","Зависит от качества и доступности стандартов сообщества и открытых проектов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مصادر المعلومات الخارجية","يعتمد على جودة ومتاحة لمعايير المجتمع ومشاريع المصدر المفتوح"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"73f12052ccc9ff4695c4a85270dea49a97a6af6015f40da1db36c0ecf76cdc83","qualityScore":57}');
