":{"en":"search-operations is a collection of Claude Code skills that enable advanced search capabilities across GitHub repositories, issues, and users","zh":"search-operations 是一个使用 gh CLI 实现 GitHub 搜索操作的技能","ja":"search-operations は、gh CLI を使用して GitHub の検索操作を実現するスキルです","ko":"search-operations는 gh CLI를 사용하여 GitHub 검색 연산을 구현하는 스킬입니다","es":"¿Qué es el skill de búsqueda de operaciones? Un conjunto de habilidades de Claude Code que replican la funcionalidad del servidor MCP de GitHub utilizando gh CLI","fr":"Qu''est-ce que le skill d''opérations de recherche? Un ensemble de compétences Claude Code qui reproduisent la fonctionnalité du serveur MCP GitHub en utilisant gh CLI","de":"Was ist das Suchoperationen-Skill? Eine Sammlung von Claude Code-Fähigkeiten, die die Funktionalität des GitHub-MCP-Servers mithilfe von gh CLI nachbilden","pt":"O search-operations é um conjunto de habilidades que permite buscas avançadas no GitHub","ru":"ИИ Агенты search-operations - это набор навыков для расширенного поиска на GitHub","ar":"وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي search-operations هي مجموعة مهارات للبحث المتقدم على جيت هاب"},"features":{"en":["Search code across GitHub repositories using gh CLI","Search issues and pull requests with advanced filters","Find repositories matching specific criteria","Search for GitHub users and organizations","Replicate GitHub MCP server functionality"],"zh":["代码搜索","问题和拉取请求搜索","仓库搜索","用户搜索","使用 gh CLI 实现搜索操作"],"ja":["コード検索","問題とプルリクエスト検索","リポジトリ検索","ユーザー検索","gh CLI を使用した検索操作"],"ko":["코드 검색","문제 및 풀 리퀘스트 검색","저장소 검색","사용자 검색","gh CLI를 사용한 검색 연산"],"es":["Búsqueda de código en repositorios de GitHub","Búsqueda de problemas y solicitudes de extracción con filtros avanzados","Búsqueda de repositorios que coinciden con criterios específicos","Búsqueda de usuarios y organizaciones de GitHub"],"fr":["Recherche de code dans les dépôts GitHub","Recherche de problèmes et de demandes d''extraction avec des filtres avancés","Recherche de dépôts correspondant à des critères spécifiques","Recherche d''utilisateurs et d''organisations GitHub"],"de":["Code-Suche in GitHub-Repositorys","Suche nach Problemen und Pull-Requests mit erweiterten Filtern","Suche nach Repositorys, die bestimmten Kriterien entsprechen","Suche nach GitHub-Benutzern und -Organisationen"],"pt":["Busca de código em repositórios do GitHub","Busca de problemas e solicitações de pull com filtros avançados","Busca de repositórios com critérios específicos","Busca de usuários e organizações no GitHub"],"ru":["Поиск кода в репозиториях GitHub","Поиск проблем и запросов на вытягивание с расширенными фильтрами","Поиск репозиториев по конкретным критериям","Поиск пользователей и организаций на GitHub"],"ar":["بحث الكود في مستودعات جيت هاب","بحث المشاكل وطلبات السحب مع المرشحات المتقدمة","بحث المستودعات بالمعايير المحددة","بحث المستخدمين والمنظمات على جيت هاب"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use search-operations","search-operations alternative","search-operations setup guide","what is search-operations","search-operations vs GitHub MCP","search-operations install"],"zh":["GitHub 搜索","代码搜索","问题搜索","拉取请求搜索","仓库搜索","用户搜索","gh CLI","search-operations","AIエージェント","GitHub搜索操作"],"ja":["GitHub検索","コード検索","問題検索","プルリクエスト検索","リポジトリ検索","ユーザー検索","gh CLI","search-operations","AIエージェント","GitHub検索操作"],"ko":["GitHub 검색","코드 검색","문제 검색","풀 리퀘스트 검색","저장소 검색","사용자 검색","gh CLI","search-operations","AI 에이전트","GitHub 검색 연산"],"es":["herramientas de búsqueda de GitHub","skill de búsqueda de operaciones","Claude Code","gh CLI","búsqueda de código en GitHub","búsqueda de problemas en GitHub","Agente de IA para desarrolladores"],"fr":["outils de recherche GitHub","compétence d''opérations de recherche","Claude Code","gh CLI","recherche de code sur GitHub","recherche de problèmes sur GitHub","Agent IA pour développeurs"],"de":["GitHub-Suchtools","Suchoperationen-Skill","Claude Code","gh CLI","Code-Suche auf GitHub","Problemm-Suche auf GitHub","KI-Agent für Entwickler"],"pt":["search-operations","GitHub","gh CLI","busca avançada","código","problemas","solicitações de pull","repositórios","usuários"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты search-operations","GitHub","gh CLI","расширенный поиск","код","проблемы","запросы на вытягивание","репозитории","пользователи"],"ar":["وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي search-operations","جيت هاب","غه CLI","بحث متقدم","كود","مشاكل","طلبات السحب","مستودعات","مستخدمين"]}},"owner":"Nice-Wolf-Studio","repo":"agent-github-skills","repoPath":"Nice-Wolf-Studio/agent-github-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.268Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"search-operations","description":"Search GitHub - find code, issues, users, and repositories across GitHub using gh CLI","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Search Operations Skill\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive search capabilities across GitHub including searching for code, issues, pull requests, repositories, and users.\n\n## Available Operations\n\n### 1. Search Code\nSearch for code across GitHub repositories.\n\n### 2. Search Issues and Pull Requests\nSearch for issues and PRs with advanced filters.\n\n### 3. Search Repositories\nFind repositories matching specific criteria.\n\n### 4. Search Users\nFind GitHub users and organizations.\n\n## Usage","body":"# GitHub Search Operations Skill\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive search capabilities across GitHub including searching for code, issues, pull requests, repositories, and users.\n\n## Available Operations\n\n### 1. Search Code\nSearch for code across GitHub repositories.\n\n### 2. Search Issues and Pull Requests\nSearch for issues and PRs with advanced filters.\n\n### 3. Search Repositories\nFind repositories matching specific criteria.\n\n### 4. Search Users\nFind GitHub users and organizations.\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n### Search Code\n\n**Basic code search:**\n```bash\ngh search code \"function authenticate\" --limit 20\n```\n\n**Search in specific language:**\n```bash\ngh search code \"async function\" --language javascript --limit 30\n```\n\n**Search in specific repository:**\n```bash\ngh search code \"TODO\" --repo owner/repo-name\n```\n\n**Search in organization:**\n```bash\ngh search code \"API_KEY\" --owner myorg\n```\n\n**Search with extension filter:**\n```bash\ngh search code \"class.*Component\" --extension tsx\n```\n\n**Search by file path:**\n```bash\ngh search code \"config\" --path \"src/config\"\n```\n\n**Complex code search:**\n```bash\ngh search code \"useState\" --language typescript --extension tsx --owner facebook\n```\n\n**Search with size filter:**\n```bash\ngh search code \"import React\" --size \">1000\"\n```\n\n**JSON output for processing:**\n```bash\ngh search code \"security vulnerability\" --json path,repository,url --jq ''.[] | {file: .path, repo: .repository.fullName}''\n```\n\n### Search Issues and Pull Requests\n\n**Search all issues:**\n```bash\ngh search issues \"memory leak\" --limit 30\n```\n\n**Search in specific repository:**\n```bash\ngh search issues \"bug\" --repo owner/repo-name\n```\n\n**Search open issues only:**\n```bash\ngh search issues \"crash\" --state open\n```\n\n**Search closed issues:**\n```bash\ngh search issues \"fixed\" --state closed\n```\n\n**Search by label:**\n```bash\ngh search issues \"bug\" --label \"critical\"\n```\n\n**Multiple labels:**\n```bash\ngh search issues \"\" --label \"bug\" --label \"security\"\n```\n\n**Search by author:**\n```bash\ngh search issues \"feature\" --author username\n```\n\n**Search by assignee:**\n```bash\ngh search issues \"\" --assignee username\n```\n\n**Search in organization:**\n```bash\ngh search issues \"todo\" --owner myorg\n```\n\n**Search by date:**\n```bash\ngh search issues \"bug\" --created \">2025-01-01\"\ngh search issues \"feature\" --updated \"<2025-01-01\"\n```\n\n**Search by comments count:**\n```bash\ngh search issues \"help wanted\" --comments \">10\"\n```\n\n**Search PRs only:**\n```bash\ngh search prs \"feat:\" --state open --limit 20\n```\n\n**Complex issue search:**\n```bash\ngh search issues \"is:open is:issue label:bug assignee:@me\"\n```\n\n**Search with reactions:**\n```bash\ngh search issues \"good first issue\" --reactions \">5\"\n```\n\n**JSON output:**\n```bash\ngh search issues \"security\" --json number,title,state,url --jq ''.[] | \"\\(.number): \\(.title)\"''\n```\n\n### Search Repositories\n\n**Basic repository search:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"machine learning\" --limit 20\n```\n\n**Search by language:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"web framework\" --language python\n```\n\n**Search by stars:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"react\" --stars \">10000\"\n```\n\n**Search by forks:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"kubernetes\" --forks \">1000\"\n```\n\n**Search by size (KB):**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"starter template\" --size \"<1000\"\n```\n\n**Search in organization:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"\" --owner microsoft\n```\n\n**Search by topic:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"topic:docker topic:kubernetes\"\n```\n\n**Search archived repositories:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"old-project\" --archived\n```\n\n**Search by license:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"utility library\" --license mit\n```\n\n**Search by creation date:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"created:>2025-01-01\"\n```\n\n**Search by last update:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"updated:>2025-01-01\" --stars \">100\"\n```\n\n**Search by number of followers:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"followers:>1000\"\n```\n\n**Complex repository search:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"stars:>5000 language:python topic:machine-learning\"\n```\n\n**JSON output:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"awesome\" --json name,owner,stars,url --jq ''.[] | \"\\(.owner.login)/\\(.name) - \\(.stars) stars\"''\n```\n\n### Search Users\n\n**Basic user search:**\n```bash\ngh search users \"john doe\" --limit 10\n```\n\n**Search by location:**\n```bash\ngh search users \"location:seattle\"\n```\n\n**Search by language:**\n```bash\ngh search users \"language:python\"\n```\n\n**Search by followers:**\n```bash\ngh search users \"followers:>1000\"\n```\n\n**Search by repositories:**\n```bash\ngh search users \"repos:>50\"\n```\n\n**Search organizations:**\n```bash\ngh search users \"type:org\"\n```\n\n**Search individual users:**\n```bash\ngh search users \"type:user\"\n```\n\n**Search by creation date:**\n```bash\ngh search users \"created:>2020-01-01\"\n```\n\n**Complex user search:**\n```bash\ngh search users \"location:california language:javascript followers:>100\"\n```\n\n**JSON output:**\n```bash\ngh search users \"location:london\" --json login,name,url --jq ''.[] | \"\\(.login): \\(.name)\"''\n```\n\n## Advanced Search Queries\n\n### GitHub Search Syntax\n\n**Boolean operators:**\n```bash\n# AND (default)\ngh search code \"class AND function\"\n\n# OR\ngh search code \"bug OR error\"\n\n# NOT\ngh search code \"NOT deprecated\"\n```\n\n**Exact phrase matching:**\n```bash\ngh search code ''\"exact phrase here\"''\n```\n\n**Wildcards:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"test*\"\n```\n\n**Range queries:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"stars:10..50\"\ngh search issues \"created:2025-01-01..2025-12-31\"\n```\n\n**Qualifiers:**\n```bash\n# Search code\ngh search code \"repo:owner/name path:src/ language:js\"\n\n# Search issues\ngh search issues \"is:open is:issue label:bug assignee:@me\"\n\n# Search PRs\ngh search prs \"is:pr is:open review:approved\"\n\n# Search repos\ngh search repos \"stars:>1000 forks:>500 language:python\"\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Find Vulnerable Code\n\n```bash\n# Search for exposed API keys\ngh search code \"API_KEY\" --language javascript\n\n# Search for TODO security items\ngh search code \"TODO.*security\" --owner myorg\n\n# Find hardcoded passwords\ngh search code \"password.*=.*[''\\\"]\" --language python\n\n# Search for SQL injection vulnerabilities\ngh search code \"query.*=.*+.*req\\.\" --language javascript\n```\n\n### Find Examples and Documentation\n\n```bash\n# Find usage examples\ngh search code \"import MyLibrary\" --language typescript\n\n# Find configuration examples\ngh search code \"filename:config.yml\" --owner popular-org\n\n# Find test examples\ngh search code \"describe.*test\" --path \"test/\" --language javascript\n```\n\n### Project Discovery\n\n```bash\n# Find active projects\ngh search repos \"stars:>100 pushed:>2025-01-01\" --language rust\n\n# Find good first issues\ngh search issues \"label:good-first-issue state:open\"\n\n# Find projects needing help\ngh search issues \"label:help-wanted state:open\" --sort comments\n\n# Find trending repositories\ngh search repos \"created:>2025-01-01\" --sort stars\n```\n\n### Competitive Analysis\n\n```bash\n# Find similar projects\ngh search repos \"web framework language:python stars:>1000\"\n\n# Find what competitors are building\ngh search repos \"owner:competitor-org\"\n\n# Track competitor issues\ngh search issues \"org:competitor-org is:open\"\n\n# See popular forks\ngh search repos \"fork:true\" --sort stars\n```\n\n### Team Collaboration\n\n```bash\n# Find your open issues\ngh search issues \"assignee:@me state:open\"\n\n# Find PRs needing review\ngh search prs \"review-requested:@me state:open\"\n\n# Find team''s open PRs\ngh search prs \"team:myorg/myteam state:open\"\n\n# Find stale issues\ngh search issues \"updated:<2024-01-01 state:open\"\n```\n\n## Sorting and Filtering\n\n### Sort Options\n\n**For repositories:**\n- `--sort stars`: Sort by star count\n- `--sort forks`: Sort by fork count\n- `--sort updated`: Sort by last update\n- `--sort help-wanted-issues`: Sort by help wanted issues\n\n```bash\ngh search repos \"javascript framework\" --sort stars --order desc\n```\n\n**For issues:**\n- `--sort comments`: Sort by comment count\n- `--sort created`: Sort by creation date\n- `--sort updated`: Sort by update date\n- `--sort reactions`: Sort by reaction count\n\n```bash\ngh search issues \"bug\" --sort comments --order desc\n```\n\n**For code:**\n- `--sort indexed`: Sort by when indexed (default)\n\n### Pagination\n\n**Limit results:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"python\" --limit 100\n```\n\n**Get more results (max 100):**\n```bash\ngh search code \"function\" --limit 100\n```\n\n## Output Formats\n\n### JSON Output\n\n**Basic JSON:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"docker\" --json name,description,stars\n```\n\n**Pipe to jq for processing:**\n```bash\ngh search repos \"kubernetes\" --json name,stars,url \\\n  | jq ''.[] | select(.stars > 1000) | {name, stars}''\n```\n\n**Extract specific fields:**\n```bash\ngh search issues \"bug\" --json number,title,state --jq ''.[] | \"\\(.number): \\(.title) [\\(.state)]\"''\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### Rate Limiting\n```bash\n# Check rate limit status\ngh api rate_limit\n\n# If rate limited, wait or authenticate\ngh auth login\n```\n\n### No Results Found\n```bash\n# Verify query syntax\ngh search repos \"test\" --limit 1\n\n# Try broader query\ngh search repos \"test*\" --limit 10\n```\n\n### Search Timeout\n```bash\n# Try more specific query\ngh search code \"function\" --repo owner/specific-repo\n\n# Use fewer qualifiers\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Be specific**: Use multiple qualifiers to narrow results\n2. **Use quotes**: For exact phrase matching\n3. **Filter early**: Apply language, repo, or org filters\n4. **Limit results**: Use `--limit` to get manageable result sets\n5. **Save queries**: Document frequently used search queries\n6. **Use JSON output**: For programmatic processing\n7. **Check rate limits**: Monitor API usage\n8. **Sort appropriately**: Use `--sort` to find most relevant results\n9. **Combine with other tools**: Pipe to jq, grep, etc.\n10. **Test queries**: Start broad, then refine\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n- Use `repository-management` after finding repos to clone or fork\n- Use `issue-management` to work with found issues\n- Use `pull-request-management` for found PRs\n- Use `code-review` to review found code\n\n## References\n\n- [GitHub CLI Search Documentation](https://cli.github.com/manual/gh_search)\n- [GitHub Search Syntax](https://docs.github.com/en/search-github/getting-started-with-searching-on-github/understanding-the-search-syntax)\n- [Searching Code](https://docs.github.com/en/search-github/searching-on-github/searching-code)\n- [Searching Issues and PRs](https://docs.github.com/en/search-github/searching-on-github/searching-issues-and-pull-requests)\n- [Searching Repositories](https://docs.github.com/en/search-github/searching-on-github/searching-for-repositories)\n- [Searching Users](https://docs.github.com/en/search-github/searching-on-github/searching-users)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:01.116Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing advanced GitHub search capabilities across code, issues, and users.","zh":"Perfect for Developer Agents 需要高级 GitHub 搜索功能，跨代码、问题和用户。","ja":"Developer Agents が高度な GitHub 検索機能を必要とする場合に最適です。コード、問題、ユーザーを横断して検索できます。","ko":"개발자 에이전트가 고급 GitHub 검색 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다. 코드, 문제, 사용자를跨으로 검색할 수 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan capacidades de búsqueda avanzadas de GitHub en código, problemas y usuarios.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant des capacités de recherche avancées GitHub sur le code, les problèmes et les utilisateurs.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickleragenten, die erweiterte GitHub-Suchfunktionen für Code, Probleme und Benutzer benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que precisam de capacidades de busca avançadas do GitHub em código, problemas e usuários.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков, которым необходимы расширенные возможности поиска GitHub по коду, проблемам и пользователям.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات بحث متقدمة على GitHub عبر الشفرة و المشكلات و المستخدمين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to search for code, issues, pull requests, repositories, and users using the gh CLI, replicating GitHub MCP server functionality with advanced filters and criteria.","zh":"赋予代理搜索代码、问题、拉取请求、存储库和用户的能力，使用 gh CLI，复制 GitHub MCP 服务器功能，具有高级过滤器和标准。","ja":"エージェントがコード、問題、プルリクエスト、リポジトリ、ユーザーを検索できるようにします。gh CLI を使用して、GitHub MCP サーバーの機能を複製し、高度なフィルタと基準を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 코드, 문제, 풀 리퀘스트, 저장소, 사용자를 검색할 수 있도록 합니다. gh CLI를 사용하여 GitHub MCP 서버 기능을 복제하고 고급 필터 및 기준을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a buscar código, problemas, solicitudes de extracción, repositorios y usuarios utilizando la CLI de gh, replicando la funcionalidad del servidor GitHub MCP con filtros y criterios avanzados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rechercher du code, des problèmes, des demandes d''extraction, des référentiels et des utilisateurs en utilisant la CLI gh, en reproduisant la fonctionnalité du serveur GitHub MCP avec des filtres et des critères avancés.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Code, Probleme, Pull-Requests, Repositorys und Benutzer mithilfe der gh-CLI zu suchen, wodurch die Funktionalität des GitHub-MCP-Servers mit erweiterten Filtern und Kriterien nachgebildet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a procurar código, problemas, solicitações de pull, repositórios e usuários usando o gh CLI, replicando a funcionalidade do servidor GitHub MCP com filtros e critérios avançados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью искать код, проблемы, запросы на включение, репозитории и пользователей с помощью gh CLI, воспроизводя функциональность сервера GitHub MCP с расширенными фильтрами и критериями.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على البحث عن شفرة و مشكلات و طلبات السحب و المستودعات و المستخدمين باستخدام واجهة السطر الأوامر gh، و يكرر وظائف خادم GitHub MCP مع مرشحات و معايير متقدمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Searching for specific code snippets across GitHub repositories","Debugging issues with advanced filters for issues and PRs","Discovering repositories and users matching specific criteria"],"zh":["在 GitHub 存储库中搜索特定的代码片段","使用高级问题和 PR 过滤器调试问题","发现匹配特定标准的存储库和用户"],"ja":["GitHub リポジトリ全体で特定のコードスニペットを検索する","高度な問題と PR フィルタを使用して問題をデバッグする","特定の基準に一致するリポジトリとユーザーを発見する"],"ko":["GitHub 저장소 전반에서 특정 코드 조각을 검색합니다","고급 문제 및 PR 필터를 사용하여 문제를 디버깅합니다","특정 기준과 일치하는 저장소 및 사용자를 발견합니다"],"es":["Buscar fragmentos de código específicos en todos los repositorios de GitHub","Depurar problemas con filtros avanzados para problemas y solicitudes de extracción","Descubrir repositorios y usuarios que coinciden con criterios específicos"],"fr":["Rechercher des extraits de code spécifiques dans tous les référentiels GitHub","Déboguer des problèmes avec des filtres avancés pour les problèmes et les demandes d''extraction","Découvrir des référentiels et des utilisateurs correspondant à des critères spécifiques"],"de":["Suchen nach spezifischen Code-Snippets in allen GitHub-Repositorys","Fehler bei Problemen mit erweiterten Filtern für Probleme und Pull-Requests beheben","Auffinden von Repositorys und Benutzern, die bestimmten Kriterien entsprechen"],"pt":["Procurar trechos de código específicos em repositórios do GitHub","Depurar problemas com filtros avançados para problemas e solicitações de pull","Descobrir repositórios e usuários que correspondem a critérios específicos"],"ru":["Поиск конкретных фрагментов кода в репозиториях GitHub","Отладка проблем с использованием расширенных фильтров для проблем и запросов на включение","Обнаружение репозиториев и пользователей, соответствующих конкретным критериям"],"ar":["البحث عن شفرة محددة في مستودعات GitHub","تصحيح الأخطاء في المشكلات باستخدام مرشحات متقدمة للمشكلات و طلبات السحب","اكتشاف المستودعات و المستخدمين الذين يطابقون معايير محددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires gh CLI installation and configuration","GitHub API rate limits apply"],"zh":["需要 gh CLI 安装和配置","适用 GitHub API 限速"],"ja":["gh CLI のインストールと設定が必要","GitHub API のレート制限が適用される"],"ko":["gh CLI 설치 및 구성이 필요합니다","GitHub API 속도 제한이 적용됩니다"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de la CLI de gh","Se aplican los límites de tasa de la API de GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de la CLI gh","Les limites de taux de l''API GitHub s''appliquent"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration der gh-CLI","GitHub-API-Rate-Limits sind anwendbar"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do gh CLI","Se aplicam limites de taxa da API do GitHub"],"ru":["Требуется установка и настройка gh CLI","Применяются ограничения скорости API GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت و تشغيل واجهة السطر الأوامر gh","تطبق حدود معدل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات GitHub"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"83e8e1ee45541dcf57b2a539e315744529edd3b9ac4cd8f37442297f1cd0f02c","qualityScore":57}');
