INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('alirezarezvani/claude-code-tresor/readme-updater', 'readme-updater', 'alirezarezvani', 'claude-code-tresor', 'community', 'readme-updater alirezarezvani claude-code-tresor community The readme-updater skill keeps your project''s README file current with changes, including new features, dependencies, and setup instructions. It benefits developers by ensuring their project documentation is always up-to-date. README更新器是一种自动化工具，用于保持项目README当前状态，包括新功能、依赖项和设置说明 READMEアップデーターは、プロジェクトのREADMEを最新の状態に保つために、新機能、依存関係、設定手順などを自動的に更新するツールです README 업데이터는 프로젝트 README를 최신 상태로 유지하기 위한 자동화 도구로, 새로운 기능, 의존성 및 설정 지침 등을 포함합니다 readme-updater es una herramienta que mantiene tus archivos README actualizados con cambios de proyecto, incluyendo nuevas características y dependencias readme-updater est un outil qui garde vos fichiers README à jour avec les modifications de projet, notamment les nouvelles fonctionnalités et les dépendances readme-updater ist ein Tool, das Ihre README-Dateien auf dem neuesten Stand hält, einschließlich neuer Funktionen und Abhängigkeiten O README Updater é uma ferramenta que atualiza automaticamente o arquivo README com alterações de projeto, incluindo novas funcionalidades e dependências README Updater - это инструмент, который автоматически обновляет файл README с изменениями проекта, включая новые функции и зависимости README Updater هو أداة تحديث ملف README تلقائيًا مع تحديثات المشروع، بما في ذلك الميزات الجديدة والاعتماديات how to use readme-updater readme-updater setup guide automated README updates readme-updater alternative readme-updater vs competing tools readme-updater install what is readme-updater readme-updater for AI agents README file management README更新器 自动化项目文档 AI工具 项目管理 README文件更新 依赖项管理 设置说明更新 Updates README installation sections with new dependencies and setup steps Modifies features sections to reflect new capabilities, functionality changes, and feature deprecation Automatically updates usage sections to ensure accurate documentation Tracks project structure changes and updates README accordingly Monitors configuration files and updates README when modifications are made readme-updater is a utility that automatically updates README sections, including installation, features, and usage, to reflect project changes and ensure accurate documentation.');
