ord الحالية وإنشاء مستندات جديدة بنفس التنسيق باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"definition":{"en":"docx-format-replicator is a skill that extracts formatting information from existing Word documents (.docx) to generate new documents with identical formatting but different content.","zh":"DOCX格式复制器是一种AI工具，用于提取和复制Word文档的格式信息","ja":"DOCX Format Replicatorは、Word文書のフォーマット情報を抽出し複製するAIエージェントの一種です","ko":"DOCX 형식 복제기는 워드 문서의 형식 정보를 추출하고 복제하는 AI 툴の一種입니다","es":"La habilidad de replicar formatos DOCX es una herramienta de inteligencia artificial que permite replicar formatos de documentos Word","fr":"La compétence de réplication de formats DOCX est un outil d''intelligence artificielle qui permet de répliquer les formats de documents Word","de":"Die Fähigkeit zum Replicieren von DOCX-Formaten ist ein KI-Tool, das das Replicieren von Word-Dokumentformaten ermöglicht","pt":"O que é um replicador de formato DOCX? É uma ferramenta que replica a formatação de documentos Word","ru":"Что такое репликатор формата DOCX? Это инструмент, который реплицирует форматирование документов Word","ar":"ما هو مكرر تنسيق DOCX؟ هو أداة تقوم بتمثيل تنسيق المستندات Word"},"features":{"en":["Extracts formatting information from existing Word documents (.docx)","Generates new documents with identical formatting but different content","Enables creating document templates with consistent formatting","Replicates complex Word document structures","Maintains consistent formatting across multiple documents"],"zh":["提取现有Word文档的格式信息","创建具有相同格式但不同内容的新文档","支持创建文档模板","维持多个文档的格式一致性","复制复杂的Word文档结构"],"ja":["既存のWord文書からのフォーマット情報の抽出","同等のフォーマットを持つ新しい文書の生成","文書テンプレートの作成をサポート","複数文書のフォーマットの一貫性の維持","複雑なWord文書構造の複製"],"ko":["기존 워드 문서에서 형식 정보를 추출","동일한 형식但 다른 내용의 새로운 문서를 생성","문서 템플릿의 생성을 지원","複数 문서의 형식の一貫性를 유지","복잡한 워드 문서 구조의 복제"],"es":["Extracción de información de formato de documentos Word existentes","Generación de nuevos documentos con formato idéntico pero contenido diferente","Creación de plantillas de documentos con formato consistente","Mantenimiento de formatos complejos de documentos Word","Compatibilidad con documentos Word (.docx)"],"fr":["Extraction des informations de format à partir de documents Word existants","Génération de nouveaux documents avec un format identique mais un contenu différent","Création de modèles de documents avec un format cohérent","Maintenance de formats complexes de documents Word","Compatibilité avec les documents Word (.docx)"],"de":["Extraktion von Formatinformationen aus bestehenden Word-Dokumenten","Erstellung neuer Dokumente mit identischem Format aber unterschiedlichem Inhalt","Erstellung von Dokumentvorlagen mit konsistentem Format","Wartung komplexer Word-Dokumentformate","Kompatibilität mit Word-Dokumenten (.docx)"],"pt":["Extração de informações de formatação de documentos Word existentes","Geração de novos documentos com formatação idêntica","Criação de modelos de documento","Manutenção de formatação consistente em múltiplos documentos","Replicação de estruturas complexas de documentos Word"],"ru":["Извлечение информации о форматировании из существующих документов Word","Генерация новых документов с идентичным форматированием","Создание шаблонов документов","Поддержание последовательного форматирования в нескольких документах","Репликация сложных структур документов Word"],"ar":["استخراج معلومات التنسيق من المستندات Word الحالية","توليد مستندات جديدة بنفس التنسيق","إنشاء قوالب مستند","الحفاظ على تنسيق متسق في العديد من المستندات","تمثيل هياكل مستندات Word المعقدة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use docx-format-replicator","docx-format-replicator alternative","docx-format-replicator setup guide","what is docx-format-replicator","docx-format-replicator vs template generators","docx-format-replicator install for AI agents"],"zh":["DOCX格式复制器","AI工具","Word文档格式","文档模板","格式一致性","文档结构复制","AIエージェント","文档处理"],"ja":["DOCX Format Replicator","AIエージェント","Word文書フォーマット","文書テンプレート","フォーマットの一貫性","文書構造複製","AIツール","文書処理"],"ko":["DOCX 형식 복제기","AI 툴","워드 문서 형식","문서 템플릿","형식の一貫性","문서 구조 복제","AI 에이전트","문서 처리"],"es":["replicar formatos DOCX","herramientas de inteligencia artificial","documentos Word","formatos de documentos","plantillas de documentos","compatibilidad con DOCX","extracción de formato","generación de documentos","creación de plantillas"],"fr":["répliquer les formats DOCX","outils d''intelligence artificielle","documents Word","formats de documents","modèles de documents","compatibilité avec DOCX","extraction de format","génération de documents","création de modèles"],"de":["DOCX-Formate replicieren","KI-Tools","Word-Dokumente","Dokumentformate","Dokumentvorlagen","Kompatibilität mit DOCX","Formatextraktion","Dokumentenerstellung","Vorlagen erstellen"],"pt":["replicador de formato DOCX","extração de formatação","geração de documentos","modelos de documento","formatação consistente","replicação de estruturas de documentos","ferramentas de produtividade","automatização de tarefas","processamento de documentos"],"ru":["репликатор формата DOCX","извлечение форматирования","генерация документов","шаблоны документов","последовательное форматирование","репликация структур документов","инструменты продуктивности","автоматизация задач","обработка документов","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["مكرر تنسيق DOCX","استخراج تنسيق","توليد مستندات","قوالب مستند","تنسيق متسق","تمثيل هياكل مستندات","أدوات الإنتاجية","أتمتة المهام","معالجة المستندات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"iamzhihuix","repo":"happy-claude-skills","repoPath":"iamzhihuix/happy-claude-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.286Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"docx-format-replicator","description":"Extract formatting from existing Word documents and generate new documents with the same format but different content. Use this skill when users need to create multiple documents with consistent formatting, replicate document templates, or maintain corporate document standards across different content.","bodyPreview":"# DOCX Format Replicator\n\n## Overview\n\nExtract formatting information from existing Word documents (.docx) and use it to generate new documents with identical formatting but different content. This skill enables creating document templates, maintaining consistent formatting across multiple documents, and replicating complex Word document structures.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n- Wants to extract formatting from an existing Word document\n- Needs to create multiple do","body":"# DOCX Format Replicator\n\n## Overview\n\nExtract formatting information from existing Word documents (.docx) and use it to generate new documents with identical formatting but different content. This skill enables creating document templates, maintaining consistent formatting across multiple documents, and replicating complex Word document structures.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n- Wants to extract formatting from an existing Word document\n- Needs to create multiple documents with the same format\n- Has a template document and wants to generate similar documents with new content\n- Asks to \"replicate\", \"copy format\", \"use the same style\", or \"create a document like\"\n- Mentions document templates, corporate standards, or format consistency\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Extract Format from Template\n\nExtract formatting information from an existing Word document to create a reusable format configuration.\n\n```bash\npython scripts/extract_format.py <template.docx> <output.json>\n```\n\n**Example**:\n```bash\npython scripts/extract_format.py \"HY研制任务书.docx\" format_template.json\n```\n\n**What Gets Extracted**:\n- Style definitions (fonts, sizes, colors, alignment)\n- Paragraph and character styles\n- Numbering schemes (1, 1.1, 1.1.1, etc.)\n- Table structures and styles\n- Header and footer configurations\n\n**Output**: JSON file containing all format information (see `references/format_config_schema.md` for details)\n\n### Step 2: Prepare Content Data\n\nCreate a JSON file with the actual content for the new document. The content must follow the structure defined in `references/content_data_schema.md`.\n\n**Content Structure**:\n```json\n{\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"title\": \"Document Title\",\n    \"author\": \"Author Name\",\n    \"version\": \"1.0\",\n    \"date\": \"2025-01-15\"\n  },\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"heading\",\n      \"content\": \"Section Title\",\n      \"level\": 1,\n      \"number\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"content\": \"Paragraph text content.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"table\",\n      \"rows\": 3,\n      \"cells\": [\n        [\"Header 1\", \"Header 2\"],\n        [\"Data 1\", \"Data 2\"]\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Supported Section Types**:\n- `heading` - Headings with optional numbering\n- `paragraph` - Text paragraphs\n- `table` - Tables with configurable rows and columns\n- `page_break` - Page breaks\n\nSee `assets/example_content.json` for a complete example.\n\n### Step 3: Generate New Document\n\nGenerate a new Word document using the extracted format and prepared content.\n\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_document.py <format.json> <content.json> <output.docx>\n```\n\n**Example**:\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_document.py format_template.json new_content.json output_document.docx\n```\n\n**Result**: A new .docx file with the format from the template applied to the new content.\n\n## Complete Example Workflow\n\nUser asks: \"I have a research task document. I need to create 5 more documents with the same format but different content.\"\n\n1. **Extract the format**:\n```bash\npython scripts/extract_format.py research_task_template.docx template_format.json\n```\n\n2. **Create content files** for each new document (content1.json, content2.json, etc.)\n\n3. **Generate documents**:\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_document.py template_format.json content1.json document1.docx\npython scripts/generate_document.py template_format.json content2.json document2.docx\n# ... repeat for all documents\n```\n\n## Common Use Cases\n\n### Corporate Document Templates\n\nExtract format from a company template and generate reports, proposals, or specifications with consistent branding.\n\n```bash\n# One-time: Extract company template\npython scripts/extract_format.py \"Company Template.docx\" company_format.json\n\n# For each new document:\npython scripts/generate_document.py company_format.json new_report.json \"Monthly Report.docx\"\n```\n\n### Technical Documentation Series\n\nCreate multiple technical documents (specifications, test plans, manuals) with identical formatting.\n\n```bash\n# Extract from specification template\npython scripts/extract_format.py spec_template.docx spec_format.json\n\n# Generate multiple specs\npython scripts/generate_document.py spec_format.json product_a_spec.json \"Product A Spec.docx\"\npython scripts/generate_document.py spec_format.json product_b_spec.json \"Product B Spec.docx\"\n```\n\n### Research Task Documents\n\nThe included example template (`assets/hy_template_format.json`) demonstrates a complete research task document format with:\n- Approval/review table in header\n- Multi-level numbering (1, 1.1, 1.1.1)\n- Technical specification tables\n- Structured sections\n\nUse this as a starting point for similar technical documents.\n\n## Advanced Usage\n\n### Customizing Extraction\n\nModify `scripts/extract_format.py` to extract additional properties not covered by default:\n- Custom XML elements\n- Advanced table features (merged cells, borders)\n- Embedded objects\n- Custom properties\n\n### Extending Content Types\n\nAdd new section types in `scripts/generate_document.py`:\n- Images with captions\n- Bulleted or numbered lists\n- Footnotes and endnotes\n- Custom content blocks\n\nSee `references/content_data_schema.md` for extension guidelines.\n\n### Batch Processing\n\nCreate a wrapper script to generate multiple documents:\n\n```python\nimport json\nimport subprocess\n\nformat_file = \"template_format.json\"\ncontent_files = [\"content1.json\", \"content2.json\", \"content3.json\"]\n\nfor i, content_file in enumerate(content_files, 1):\n    output = f\"document_{i}.docx\"\n    subprocess.run([\n        \"python\", \"scripts/generate_document.py\",\n        format_file, content_file, output\n    ])\n```\n\n## Dependencies\n\nThe scripts require:\n- Python 3.7+\n- `python-docx` library: `pip install python-docx`\n\nNo additional dependencies are needed for the core functionality.\n\n## Resources\n\n### scripts/\n\n- **extract_format.py** - Extract formatting from Word documents\n- **generate_document.py** - Generate new documents from format + content\n\nBoth scripts include built-in help:\n```bash\npython scripts/extract_format.py --help\npython scripts/generate_document.py --help\n```\n\n### references/\n\n- **format_config_schema.md** - Complete schema for format configuration files\n- **content_data_schema.md** - Complete schema for content data files\n\nRead these for detailed information on file structures and available options.\n\n### assets/\n\n- **hy_template_format.json** - Example extracted format from a technical research task document\n- **example_content.json** - Example content data showing all section types\n\nUse these as references when creating your own format and content files.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Missing styles in output**: Ensure style IDs in content data match those in format config. Check `format.json` for available style IDs.\n\n**Table formatting issues**: Verify table dimensions (rows/columns) match between content data and format config. See `format_config_schema.md` for table structure.\n\n**Font not displaying correctly**: Some fonts may not be available on all systems. Check that referenced fonts are installed.\n\n**Dependencies missing**: Install required Python packages:\n```bash\npip install python-docx\n```\n\n## Tips\n\n1. **Test with examples first**: Use the included `hy_template_format.json` and `example_content.json` to understand the workflow before extracting your own formats.\n\n2. **Start simple**: Begin with basic headings and paragraphs, then add tables and complex formatting.\n\n3. **Validate JSON**: Use a JSON validator to check content data files before generating documents.\n\n4. **Keep format configs**: Store extracted format configurations for reuse across multiple projects.\n\n5. **Version control**: Track both format configs and content data in version control for reproducible document generation.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:58.459Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Automation Agents needing precise Word document formatting replication.","zh":"适合需要精确复制 Word 文档格式的文档自动化代理。","ja":"Word 文書の正確な書式設定の複製が必要な文書自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Word 문서 형식의 정확한 복제가 필요한 문서 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización de Documentos que necesitan una replicación precisa del formato de documentos de Word.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Automatisation de Documents nécessitant une réplication précise du formatage de documents Word.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentautomationsagenten, die eine präzise Replikation des Word-Dokumenten-Formatierungsformats benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Documentos que necessitam de replicação precisa de formatação de documentos do Word.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации документов, которым требуется точная репликация форматирования документов Word.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء أتمتة الوثائق التي تحتاج إلى نسخ دقيقة من تنسيق المستندات وورد."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract and replicate complex .docx formatting, enabling consistent branding and templating across multiple documents using Microsoft Word''s OpenXML format.","zh":"赋予代理提取和复制复杂的 .docx 格式，实现多个文档跨 Microsoft Word 的 OpenXML 格式的一致品牌和模板。","ja":"エージェントが複雑な .docx 形式を抽出および複製できるようにし、Microsoft Word の OpenXML 形式を使用して複数の文書に