с базой данных для поиска сущностей","Поддержка последовательного выполнения одобренных элементов","Вывод результатов в ~/CybosVault/private/content/work/"],"ar":["تشغيل تلقائي للمهام من عناصر GTD.md","تصنيف و تخطيط الإجراءات لكل عنصر","دمج مع قاعدة بيانات للبحث عن الكيانات","دعم تشغيل متتالي للعناصر المعتمدة","إخراج النتائج في ~/CybosVault/private/content/work/"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use gtd","gtd setup guide","gtd alternative","gtd vs todo list","autonomous task execution","GTD.md file format","bun scripts database integration","cyber-gtd command"],"zh":["GTD Runner Skill","自动任务执行","GTD.md","数据库查询","CLI 命令","任务自动化","生产力工具","AI エージェント"],"ja":["GTD Runner スキル","自動タスク実行","GTD.md","データベースクエリ","CLI コマンド","タスク自動化","生産性ツール","AIエージェント"],"ko":["GTD 태스크 자동 실행 스킬","자동 태스크 실행","GTD.md","데이터베이스 쿼리","CLI 명령","태스크 자동화","생산성 도구","AI 에이전트"],"es":["GTD","agente de inteligencia artificial","ejecución autónoma de tareas","productividad","automatización de tareas","integración con bases de datos","búsqueda de entidades","planificación de acciones"],"fr":["GTD","agent d''intelligence artificielle","exécution autonome de tâches","productivité","automatisation de tâches","intégration avec des bases de données","recherche d''entités","planification d''actions"],"de":["GTD","künstlicher Intelligenz-Agent","autonome Ausführung von Aufgaben","Produktivität","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Integration mit Datenbanken","Entitätensuche","Aktionen planen"],"pt":["GTD Runner","automação de tarefas","execução autônoma","GTD.md","classificação de tarefas","planejamento de ações","integração com banco de dados","lookup de entidades","execução sequencial"],"ru":["GTD Runner","автоматизация задач","автономное выполнение","GTD.md","классификация задач","планирование действий","интеграция с базой данных","поиск сущностей","последовательное выполнение"],"ar":["GTD Runner","تشغيل تلقائي للمهام","تنفيذ تلقائي","GTD.md","تصنيف المهام","تخطيط الإجراءات","دمج مع قاعدة بيانات","بحث عن الكيانات","تنفيذ متتالي"]}},"owner":"Gerstep","repo":"cybos","repoPath":"Gerstep/cybos","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.292Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gtd","description":"Autonomous task execution from GTD.md items. Use when processing GTD tasks, call prep, outreach, or podcast preparation.","bodyPreview":"# GTD Runner Skill\n\nAutonomous task execution from GTD.md items.\n\n## Trigger\n\n- Command: `/cyber-gtd`\n- Default: plan-first (show before execute)\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Read `@GTD.md` → extract items from `# Next`\n2. For each item:\n   - Classify → match pattern to workflow\n   - Lookup entities via database: `bun scripts/db/query.ts find-entity \"<name>\"`\n   - Plan actions\n3. Show plan → ask to execute\n4. Execute approved items sequentially (one at a time)\n5. Output: `~/CybosVault/private/content/work/M","body":"# GTD Runner Skill\n\nAutonomous task execution from GTD.md items.\n\n## Trigger\n\n- Command: `/cyber-gtd`\n- Default: plan-first (show before execute)\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Read `@GTD.md` → extract items from `# Next`\n2. For each item:\n   - Classify → match pattern to workflow\n   - Lookup entities via database: `bun scripts/db/query.ts find-entity \"<name>\"`\n   - Plan actions\n3. Show plan → ask to execute\n4. Execute approved items sequentially (one at a time)\n5. Output: `~/CybosVault/private/content/work/MMDD-<slug>.md`\n\n## Classification → Routing\n\n| Pattern | Confidence | Workflow |\n|---------|------------|----------|\n| \"ask for call\", \"message\", \"email\", \"reach out\" | High | → workflows/outreach.md |\n| \"call with\", \"meeting\", \"X <> Y\", \"sync\" | High | → workflows/call-prep.md |\n| \"podcast\" | High | → workflows/podcast.md |\n| company name, \"research\", \"DD\", \"look into\" | Medium | → workflows/research.md |\n| **no match** | Low | Best judgment → log to learnings.md |\n\n## Entity Lookup\n\nQuery database for entity context:\n\n1. Parse item for names (people, companies)\n2. Run: `bun scripts/db/query.ts find-entity \"<name>\" --json`\n3. If found, get full context: `bun scripts/db/query.ts entity <slug> --json`\n4. Entity context includes:\n   - Recent interactions (calls, emails, telegram)\n   - Deal associations\n   - Pending items\n5. If not found + confident it''s an entity:\n   - High confidence (company with domain) → auto-create stub\n   - Medium confidence → ask: \"Create entity file for X?\"\n\n## Output Format\n\nAll outputs to `~/CybosVault/private/content/work/MMDD-<slug>.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Task: [Task Description]\n\n**Status:** Pending Approval | Completed | Incomplete\n**Created:** YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM\n**GTD Item:** [Original text from GTD.md]\n**Workflow:** [Which workflow handled this]\n\n---\n\n## Context\n\n**Entity:** [Name]\n- Type: [person/org]\n- Deal: [link if exists]\n- Previous calls: [N calls found]\n\n**Key Info:**\n[Relevant context from calls, deals, entity files]\n\n---\n\n## Draft\n\n[Message/agenda/questions/etc]\n\n---\n\n## Pending Actions\n\n- [ ] Send via Gmail to email@example.com\n- [ ] Alternative: Telegram @handle\n\n---\n\n## Execution Log\n\n- HH:MM - [action taken]\n```\n\n## Staged Execution\n\nAgent completes what it can autonomously:\n- Research and context gathering\n- Draft creation\n- Preparation work\n\nThen queues actions requiring approval:\n- Sending messages (Gmail, Telegram)\n- Scheduling meetings\n- Any external action\n\n## Suggestions\n\nWhen processing tasks, if you notice 3+ similar patterns that don''t have\na dedicated workflow, suggest: \"I''ve seen ''[pattern]'' multiple times.\nWant me to create a workflow for it?\"\n\n## Self-Improvement\n\nLog all task executions to `@learnings.md` for pattern analysis.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:04.846Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Task Automation Agents requiring streamlined workflow execution from GTD.md items","zh":"适合需要从GTD.md项目简化工作流执行的任务自动化代理","ja":"GTD.mdアイテムからのワークフローの実行を簡素化するタスク自動化エージェントに最適","ko":"GTD.md 항목에서 워크플로우 실행을 간소화하는 태스크 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización de Tareas que requieren una ejecución de flujo de trabajo optimizada desde elementos de GTD.md","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Automatisation de Tâches nécessitant une exécution de workflow optimisée à partir d''éléments GTD.md","de":"Ideal für Task-Automatisierungsagenten, die eine optimierte Workflow-Ausführung aus GTD.md-Elementen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de Tarefas que requerem execução de fluxo de trabalho simplificado a partir de itens do GTD.md","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации задач, требующих упрощенного выполнения рабочего процесса из элементов GTD.md","ar":"مثالي لعميل تلقيم المهام الذي يتطلب تنفيذاً متدفقاً للعمل من عناصر GTD.md"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate task execution using specific commands like `/cyber-gtd`, classify items, and plan actions via entity lookup and database queries using `bun scripts/db/query.ts`","zh":"赋予代理使用特定命令如 `/cyber-gtd` 自动执行任务，使用 `bun scripts/db/query.ts` 进行实体查找和数据库查询来分类项目和计划操作","ja":"`/cyber-gtd` などの特定のコマンドを使用してタスクの実行を自動化し、`bun scripts/db/query.ts` を使用したエンティティの検索とデータベースのクエリを使用してアイテムを分類および操作を計画するエージェントをEmpowerする","ko":"`/cyber-gtd`와 같은 특정 명령을 사용하여 태스크 실행을 자동화하고 `bun scripts/db/query.ts`를 사용한 엔티티 조회 및 데이터베이스 쿼리를 사용하여 항목을 분류하고 작업을 계획하는 에이전트를赋予权限","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la ejecución de tareas utilizando comandos específicos como `/cyber-gtd`, clasificar elementos y planificar acciones a través de la búsqueda de entidades y consultas de base de datos utilizando `bun scripts/db/query.ts`","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser l''exécution de tâches en utilisant des commandes spécifiques comme `/cyber-gtd`, classer des éléments et planifier des actions via la recherche d''entités et des requêtes de base de données en utilisant `bun scripts/db/query.ts`","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Ausführung von Tasks mithilfe spezifischer Befehle wie `/cyber-gtd` zu automatisieren, Elemente zu klassifizieren und Aktionen über die Entitätssuche und Datenbankabfragen unter Verwendung von `bun scripts/db/query.ts` zu planen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a execução de tarefas usando comandos específicos como `/cyber-gtd`, classificar itens e planejar ações por meio de busca de entidades e consultas de banco de dados usando `bun scripts/db/query.ts`","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать выполнение задач с помощью специальных команд, таких как `/cyber-gtd`, классифицировать элементы и планировать действия посредством поиска сущностей и запросов к базе данных с использованием `bun scripts/db/query.ts`","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تلقيم تنفيذ المهام باستخدام أوامر محددة مثل `/cyber-gtd` ، وتصنيف العناصر وتخطيط الإجراءات من خلال البحث عن الكيانات وعمليات استفسار قاعدة البيانات باستخدام `bun scripts/db/query.ts`"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task execution from GTD.md items","Classifying items and planning actions","Executing approved items sequentially"],"zh":["自动执行GTD.md项目中的任务","分类项目并计划操作","顺序执行批准的项目"],"ja":["GTD.mdアイテムからのタスクの自動実行","アイテムの分類と操作の計画","承認されたアイテムのシーケンシャル実行"],"ko":["GTD.md 항목에서 태스크 자동 실행","항목 분류 및 작업 계획","승인된 항목의 순차적 실행"],"es":["Automatizar la ejecución de tareas desde elementos de GTD.md","Clasificar elementos y planificar acciones","Ejecutar elementos aprobados secuencialmente"],"fr":["Automatiser l''exécution de tâches à partir d''éléments GTD.md","Classer des éléments et planifier des actions","Exécuter des éléments approuvés de manière séquentielle"],"de":["Automatisierung der Task-Ausführung aus GTD.md-Elementen","Klassifizieren von Elementen und Planen von Aktionen","Ausführen von genehmigten Elementen in sequenzieller Reihenfolge"],"pt":["Automatizar a execução de tarefas a partir de itens do GTD.md","Classificar itens e planejar ações","Executar itens aprovados sequencialmente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать выполнение задач из элементов GTD.md","Классифицировать элементы и планировать действия","Выполнять утвержденные элементы последовательно"],"ar":["تلقيم تنفيذ المهام من عناصر GTD.md","تصنيف العناصر وتخطيط الإجراءات","تنفيذ العناصر المعتمدة على التوالي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GTD.md file setup","Dependent on `bun scripts/db/query.ts` for entity lookup"],"zh":["需要GTD.md文件设置","依赖于 `bun scripts/db/query.ts` 进行实体查找"],"ja":["GTD.mdファイルの設定が必要","`bun scripts/db/query.ts` への依存によるエンティティの検索"],"ko":["GTD.md 파일 설정 필요","`bun scripts/db/query.ts`를 통한 엔티티 조회에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración del archivo GTD.md","Dependiente de `bun scripts/db/query.ts` para la búsqueda de entidades"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration du fichier GTD.md","Dépend de `bun scripts/db/query.ts` pour la recherche d''entités"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung der GTD.md-Datei","Abhängig von `bun scripts/db/query.ts` für die Entitätssuche"],"pt":["Requer configuração do arquivo GTD.md","Depende de `bun scripts/db/query.ts` para busca de entidades"],"ru":["Требует настройки файла GTD.md","Зависит от `bun scripts/db/query.ts` для поиска сущностей"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد ملف GTD.md","يعتمد على `bun scripts/db/query.ts` للبحث عن الكيانات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"61c7adb4a70f3e66197fdb3b747d860e475628ccba6c23519a94e5cd5a79c8c6","qualityScore":57}');
