INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('natea/fitfinder/threejs-game', 'threejs-game', 'natea', 'fitfinder', 'community', 'threejs-game natea fitfinder community The threejs-game skill provides comprehensive assistance with Three.js game development, helping developers build 3D web games with features like physics, animations, and user input handling. It benefits developers looking to create immersive browser-based games. Three.js 游戏开发技能提供了使用 Three.js 和 WebGL 进行 3D 游戏开发的综合帮助，包括 3D 渲染、游戏机制、物理、动画和交互式浏览器游戏 Three.js ゲーム開発スキルは、Three.js と WebGL を使用した 3D ゲーム開発の包括的な支援を提供します。3D レンダリング、ゲームメカニクス、物理、アニメーション、インタラクティブ ブラウザ ゲーム Three.js 게임 개발 스킬은 Three.js와 WebGL을 사용한 3D 게임 개발의 포괄적인 지원을 제공합니다. 3D 렌더링, 게임 메커니즘, 물리, 애니메이션, 인터랙티브 브라우저 게임 El skill threejs-game ofrece asistencia integral para el desarrollo de juegos con Three.js, incluyendo renderizado 3D, mecánicas de juego y física Le skill threejs-game offre une aide complète pour le développement de jeux avec Three.js, y compris le rendu 3D, la mécanique de jeu et la physique Der Skill threejs-game bietet umfassende Unterstützung für die Entwicklung von Spielen mit Three.js, einschließlich 3D-Rendering, Spielmechanik und Physik Three.js Game é uma habilidade que fornece assistência abrangente para o desenvolvimento de jogos 3D no navegador Three.js Game — это навык, который обеспечивает всестороннюю помощь в разработке 3D-игр в браузере Three.js Game هو مهارة توفر مساعدة شاملة لإنشاء ألعاب 3D في المتصفح how to use threejs-game threejs-game setup guide threejs-game vs PlayCanvas threejs-game install what is threejs-game threejs-game alternative threejs-game game development threejs-game WebGL tutorial threejs-game 3D rendering Three.js 游戏开发 WebGL 游戏开发 3D 游戏开发 游戏机制 物理引擎 动画 交互式浏览器游戏 AI 工具 Three.js 教程 Building 3D web games with Three.js and WebGL Implementing game mechanics like player movement, collisions, and scoring Setting up cameras, lighting, and scene management for optimal rendering Loading 3D models in GLTF, OBJ, and FBX formats Handling user input from keyboard, mouse, touch, and other devices threejs-game is a skill that assists with Three.js game development using WebGL, covering aspects like 3D rendering, game mechanics, and interactive browser-based games.');
