ten API-Diensten für die Kommunikation mit dem Backend","pt":"O serviço de API Angular é um framework para criar serviços de API para aplicações Angular","ru":"Сервис API Angular - это фреймворк для создания сервисов API для приложений Angular","ar":"خدمة API Angular هي إطار عمل لإنشاء خدمات API لتطبيقات Angular"},"features":{"en":["Creates new API services for backend communication","Adds caching to API calls for improved performance","Implements file upload/download functionality","Supports custom headers and interceptors for API requests","Identifies backend API base URL for service configuration","Lists all endpoints to implement for comprehensive API coverage"],"zh":["创建新 API 服务","添加缓存到 API 调用","实现文件上传和下载","添加自定义头部和拦截器"],"ja":["新しい API サービスを作成する","API 呼び出しにキャッシュを追加する","ファイルのアップロードとダウンロードを実装する","カスタムヘッダーとインターセプターを追加する"],"ko":["새로운 API 서비스 생성","API 호출에 캐시 추가","파일 업로드 및 다운로드 구현","사용자 정의 헤더 및 인터셉터 추가"],"es":["Creación de servicios de API personalizados","Implementación de caché para mejorar el rendimiento","Agregar encabezados personalizados a las solicitudes","Implementación de carga y descarga de archivos","Identificación de la URL base del API de backend"],"fr":["Création de services API personnalisés","Mise en œuvre du cache pour améliorer les performances","Ajout d''en-têtes personnalisés aux requêtes","Mise en œuvre du téléchargement et du téléchargement de fichiers","Identification de l''URL de base de l''API de backend"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten API-Diensten","Implementierung von Cache für bessere Leistung","Hinzufügen von benutzerdefinierten Headern zu den Anfragen","Implementierung von Datei-Upload und -Download","Identifizierung der Basis-URL des Backend-API"],"pt":["Criação de serviços de API para comunicação de backend","Implementação de cache para chamadas de API","Upload e download de arquivos","Adição de cabeçalhos personalizados ou interceptores"],"ru":["Создание сервисов API для коммуникации с бэкендом","Реализация кэширования для вызовов API","Загрузка и скачивание файлов","Добавление пользовательских заголовков или интерцепторов"],"ar":["إنشاء خدمات API للتواصل مع الخادم الخلفي","تنفيذ ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت لاستدعاءات API","رفع وتنزيل الملفات","إضافة رؤوس مخصصة أو مرشحات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use angular-api-service","angular-api-service setup guide","angular-api-service vs REST API","angular-api-service install","what is angular-api-service","angular-api-service alternative","angular-api-service tutorial","angular-api-service best practices","angular-api-service example"],"zh":["Angular API 服务","后端通信","API 调用","缓存","文件上传","自定义头部","AI 工具","开发工作流程"],"ja":["Angular API サービス","バックエンド通信","API 呼び出し","キャッシュ","ファイルアップロード","カスタムヘッダー","AI エージェント","開発ワークフロー"],"ko":["Angular API 서비스","백엔드 통신","API 호출","캐시","파일 업로드","사용자 정의 헤더","AI 도구","개발 워크플로우"],"es":["Angular API Service","servicio API de Angular","comunicación con el backend","caché en API","encabezados personalizados en API","carga y descarga de archivos en API","herramientas de desarrollo de API","mejora del rendimiento de API"],"fr":["Service API Angular","service API personnalisé","communication avec le backend","cache dans l''API","en-têtes personnalisés dans l''API","téléchargement et téléchargement de fichiers dans l''API","outils de développement d''API","amélioration des performances de l''API"],"de":["Angular API Service","benutzerdefinierter API-Dienst","Kommunikation mit dem Backend","Cache in der API","benutzerdefinierte Header in der API","Datei-Upload und -Download in der API","Entwicklungstools für API","Leistungsverbesserung von API"],"pt":["angular api service","serviço de api angular","configuração de api","cache api angular","upload de arquivos angular","cabeçalhos personalizados angular","ferramentas de desenvolvimento angular","ИИ Агенты para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["angular api сервис","сервис api angular","настройка api","кэш api angular","загрузка файлов angular","пользовательские заголовки angular","инструменты разработки angular","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков"],"ar":["خدمة api angular","خدمة api أنجولار","إعداد api","ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت api angular","رفع الملفات أنجولار","رؤوس مخصصة أنجولار","أدوات تطوير أنجولار","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي لل مطورين"]}},"owner":"CongDon1207","repo":"AGENTS.md","repoPath":"CongDon1207/AGENTS.md","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.298Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"angular-api-service","description":"Use when creating API services for backend communication with proper patterns for caching, error handling, and type safety.","bodyPreview":"# Angular API Service Development Workflow\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating new API service for backend communication\n- Adding caching to API calls\n- Implementing file upload/download\n- Adding custom headers or interceptors\n\n## Pre-Flight Checklist\n\n- [ ] Identify backend API base URL\n- [ ] **Read the design system docs** for the target application (see below)\n- [ ] List all endpoints to implement\n- [ ] Determine caching requirements\n- [ ] Search existing services: `grep \"{Feature}ApiServi","body":"# Angular API Service Development Workflow\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating new API service for backend communication\n- Adding caching to API calls\n- Implementing file upload/download\n- Adding custom headers or interceptors\n\n## Pre-Flight Checklist\n\n- [ ] Identify backend API base URL\n- [ ] **Read the design system docs** for the target application (see below)\n- [ ] List all endpoints to implement\n- [ ] Determine caching requirements\n- [ ] Search existing services: `grep \"{Feature}ApiService\" --include=\"*.ts\"`\n\n## 🎨 Design System Documentation (MANDATORY)\n\n**Before creating any API service, read the design system documentation for your target application:**\n\n| Application                       | Design System Location                           |\n| --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| **WebV2 Apps**                    | `docs/design-system/`                            |\n| **TextSnippetClient**             | `src/PlatformExampleAppWeb/apps/playground-text-snippet/docs/design-system/` |\n\n**Key docs to read:**\n\n- `README.md` - Component overview, base classes, library summary\n- `07-technical-guide.md` - Implementation checklist, best practices\n- `06-state-management.md` - State management and API integration patterns\n\n## File Location\n\n```\nsrc/PlatformExampleAppWeb/libs/apps-domains/src/lib/\n└── {domain}/\n    └── services/\n        └── {feature}-api.service.ts\n```\n\n## Pattern 1: Basic CRUD API Service\n\n```typescript\n// {feature}-api.service.ts\nimport { Injectable } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { Observable } from ''rxjs'';\nimport { PlatformApiService } from ''@libs/platform-core'';\nimport { environment } from ''@env/environment'';\n\n// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n// DTOs (can be in separate file)\n// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nexport interface FeatureDto {\n    id: string;\n    name: string;\n    code: string;\n    status: FeatureStatus;\n    createdDate: Date;\n}\n\nexport interface FeatureListQuery {\n    searchText?: string;\n    statuses?: FeatureStatus[];\n    skipCount?: number;\n    maxResultCount?: number;\n}\n\nexport interface PagedResult<T> {\n    items: T[];\n    totalCount: number;\n}\n\nexport interface SaveFeatureCommand {\n    id?: string;\n    name: string;\n    code: string;\n    status: FeatureStatus;\n}\n\n// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n// API SERVICE\n// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class FeatureApiService extends PlatformApiService {\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // CONFIGURATION\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    protected get apiUrl(): string {\n        return environment.apiUrl + ''/api/Feature'';\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // QUERY METHODS\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    getList(query?: FeatureListQuery): Observable<PagedResult<FeatureDto>> {\n        return this.get<PagedResult<FeatureDto>>('''', query);\n    }\n\n    getById(id: string): Observable<FeatureDto> {\n        return this.get<FeatureDto>(`/${id}`);\n    }\n\n    getByCode(code: string): Observable<FeatureDto> {\n        return this.get<FeatureDto>(''/by-code'', { code });\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // COMMAND METHODS\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    save(command: SaveFeatureCommand): Observable<FeatureDto> {\n        return this.post<FeatureDto>('''', command);\n    }\n\n    update(id: string, command: Partial<SaveFeatureCommand>): Observable<FeatureDto> {\n        return this.put<FeatureDto>(`/${id}`, command);\n    }\n\n    delete(id: string): Observable<void> {\n        return this.deleteRequest<void>(`/${id}`);\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // VALIDATION METHODS\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    checkCodeExists(code: string, excludeId?: string): Observable<boolean> {\n        return this.get<boolean>(''/check-code-exists'', { code, excludeId });\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Pattern 2: API Service with Caching\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class LookupApiService extends PlatformApiService {\n    protected get apiUrl(): string {\n        return environment.apiUrl + ''/api/Lookup'';\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // CACHED METHODS\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    getCountries(): Observable<CountryDto[]> {\n        return this.get<CountryDto[]>(''/countries'', null, {\n            enableCache: true,\n            cacheKey: ''countries'',\n            cacheDurationMs: 60 * 60 * 1000 // 1 hour\n        });\n    }\n\n    getCurrencies(): Observable<CurrencyDto[]> {\n        return this.get<CurrencyDto[]>(''/currencies'', null, {\n            enableCache: true,\n            cacheKey: ''currencies''\n        });\n    }\n\n    getTimezones(): Observable<TimezoneDto[]> {\n        return this.get<TimezoneDto[]>(''/timezones'', null, {\n            enableCache: true\n        });\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // CACHE INVALIDATION\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    invalidateCountriesCache(): void {\n        this.clearCache(''countries'');\n    }\n\n    invalidateAllCache(): void {\n        this.clearAllCache();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Pattern 3: File Upload/Download\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class DocumentApiService extends PlatformApiService {\n    protected get apiUrl(): string {\n        return environment.apiUrl + ''/api/Document'';\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // FILE UPLOAD\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    upload(file: File, metadata?: DocumentMetadata): Observable<DocumentDto> {\n        const formData = new FormData();\n        formData.append(''file'', file, file.name);\n\n        if (metadata) {\n            formData.append(''metadata'', JSON.stringify(metadata));\n        }\n\n        return this.postFormData<DocumentDto>(''/upload'', formData);\n    }\n\n    uploadMultiple(files: File[]): Observable<DocumentDto[]> {\n        const formData = new FormData();\n        files.forEach((file, index) => {\n            formData.append(`files[${index}]`, file, file.name);\n        });\n\n        return this.postFormData<DocumentDto[]>(''/upload-multiple'', formData);\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // FILE DOWNLOAD\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    download(id: string): Observable<Blob> {\n        return this.getBlob(`/${id}/download`);\n    }\n\n    downloadAsBase64(id: string): Observable<string> {\n        return this.get<string>(`/${id}/base64`);\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // HELPER: Trigger browser download\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    downloadAndSave(id: string, fileName: string): Observable<void> {\n        return this.download(id).pipe(\n            tap(blob => {\n                const url = window.URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n                const link = document.createElement(''a'');\n                link.href = url;\n                link.download = fileName;\n                link.click();\n                window.URL.revokeObjectURL(url);\n            }),\n            map(() => void 0)\n        );\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Pattern 4: API Service with Custom Headers\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class ExternalApiService extends PlatformApiService {\n    protected get apiUrl(): string {\n        return environment.externalApiUrl;\n    }\n\n    // Override to add custom headers\n    protected override getDefaultHeaders(): HttpHeaders {\n        return super.getDefaultHeaders().set(''X-Api-Key'', environment.externalApiKey).set(''X-Request-Id'', this.generateRequestId());\n    }\n\n    // Method with custom headers\n    getWithCustomHeaders(endpoint: string): Observable<any> {\n        return this.get(endpoint, null, {\n            headers: {\n                ''X-Custom-Header'': ''custom-value''\n            }\n        });\n    }\n\n    private generateRequestId(): string {\n        return `${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 9)}`;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Pattern 5: Search/Autocomplete API\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class EmployeeApiService extends PlatformApiService {\n\n  protected get apiUrl(): string {\n    return environment.apiUrl + ''/api/Employee'';\n  }\n\n  // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  // SEARCH WITH DEBOUNCE (use in component)\n  // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n  search(term: string): Observable<EmployeeDto[]> {\n    if (!term || term.length < 2) {\n      return of([]);\n    }\n\n    return this.get<EmployeeDto[]>(''/search'', {\n      searchText: term,\n      maxResultCount: 10\n    });\n  }\n\n  // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  // AUTOCOMPLETE WITH CACHING\n  // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n  autocomplete(prefix: string): Observable<AutocompleteItem[]> {\n    return this.get<AutocompleteItem[]>(''/autocomplete'', { prefix }, {\n      enableCache: true,\n      cacheKey: `autocomplete-${prefix}`,\n      cacheDurationMs: 30 * 1000  // 30 seconds\n    });\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage in component with debounce:\n@Component({...})\nexport class EmployeeSearchComponent {\n  private searchSubject = new Subject<string>();\n\n  search$ = this.searchSubject.pipe(\n    debounceTime(300),\n    distinctUntilChanged(),\n    switchMap(term => this.employeeApi.search(term))\n  );\n\n  onSearchInput(term: string): void {\n    this.searchSubject.next(term);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Base PlatformApiService Methods\n\n| Method               | Purpose              | Example                                  |\n| -------------------- | -------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `get<T>()`           | GET request          | `this.get<User>(''/users/1'')`             |\n| `post<T>()`          | POST request         | `this.post<User>(''/users'', data)`        |\n| `put<T>()`           | PUT request          | `this.put<User>(''/users/1'', data)`       |\n| `patch<T>()`         | PATCH request        | `this.patch<User>(''/users/1'', partial)`  |\n| `deleteRequest<T>()` | DELETE request       | `this.deleteRequest(''/users/1'')`         |\n| `postFormData<T>()`  | POST with FormData   | `this.postFormData(''/upload'', formData)` |\n| `getBlob()`          | GET binary data      | `this.getBlob(''/file/download'')`         |\n| `clearCache()`       | Clear specific cache | `this.clearCache(''cacheKey'')`            |\n| `clearAllCache()`    | Clear all cache      | `this.clearAllCache()`                   |\n\n## Request Options\n\n```typescript\ninterface RequestOptions {\n    // Caching\n    enableCache?: boolean;\n    cacheKey?: string;\n    cacheDurationMs?: number;\n\n    // Headers\n    headers?: { [key: string]: string };\n\n    // Response handling\n    responseType?: ''json'' | ''text'' | ''blob'' | ''arraybuffer'';\n\n    // Progress tracking\n    reportProgress?: boolean;\n    observe?: ''body'' | ''events'' | ''response'';\n}\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns to AVOID\n\n:x: **Using HttpClient directly**\n\n```typescript\n// WRONG - bypasses platform features\nconstructor(private http: HttpClient) { }\n\n// CORRECT - extend PlatformApiService\nexport class MyApiService extends PlatformApiService { }\n```\n\n:x: **Hardcoding URLs**\n\n```typescript\n// WRONG\nreturn this.get(''https://api.example.com/users'');\n\n// CORRECT - use environment\nprotected get apiUrl() { return environment.apiUrl + ''/api/User''; }\n```\n\n:x: **Not handling errors in service**\n\n```typescript\n// WRONG - let errors propagate unhandled\nreturn this.get(''/users'');\n\n// CORRECT - component handles via tapResponse\nthis.userApi.getUsers().pipe(\n    this.tapResponse(\n        users => {\n            /* success */\n        },\n        error => {\n            /* handle error */\n        }\n    )\n);\n```\n\n:x: **Missing type safety**\n\n```typescript\n// WRONG - returns any\ngetUser(id: string) {\n  return this.get(`/users/${id}`);\n}\n\n// CORRECT - typed response\ngetUser(id: string): Observable<UserDto> {\n  return this.get<UserDto>(`/users/${id}`);\n}\n```\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\n- [ ] Extends `PlatformApiService`\n- [ ] `apiUrl` getter returns correct base URL\n- [ ] All methods have return type annotations\n- [ ] DTOs defined for request/response\n- [ ] Caching configured for appropriate endpoints\n- [ ] File operations use `postFormData`/`getBlob`\n- [ ] Validation endpoints return `boolean`\n- [ ] `@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })` for singleton\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:21.701Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing efficient Angular API service creation with caching and custom headers.","zh":"非常适合需要高效 Angular API 服务创建、缓存和自定义头的前端代理。","ja":"Angular API サービスの作成にキャッシュとカスタムヘッダーが必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"эффектив한 Angular API 서비스 생성, 캐싱 및 사용자 지정 헤더가 필요한 프런트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan una creación de servicios de API de Angular eficiente con caché y encabezados personalizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une création de services d''API Angular efficace avec mise en cache et en-têtes personnalisés.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine effiziente Erstellung von Angular-API-Diensten mit Caching und benutzerdefinierten Headern benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de criação de serviço de API Angular eficiente com cache e cabeçalhos personalizados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуется эффективное создание служб API Angular с кэшированием и настраиваемыми заголовками.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء خدمة API Angular فعالة مع التخزين المؤقت والرؤوس المخصصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create new API services for backend communication, adding caching and custom headers, and implementing file upload/download using Angular''s HTTP Client, enabling seamless interaction with backend APIs via HTTP protocols.","zh":"赋予代理创建新的 API 服务用于后端通信的能力，包括添加缓存和自定义头，并使用 Angular 的 HTTP 客户端实现文件上传/下载，实现与后端 API 的无缝交互。","ja":"エージェントは Angular の HTTP クライアントを使用して、バックエンドとの通信用に新しい API サービスを作成し、キャッシュとカスタムヘッダーを追加し、ファイルのアップロード/ダウンロード機能を実装して、バックエンド API との無縫なやり取りを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 백엔드 통신용으로 새로운 API 서비스를 생성하고 캐싱 및 사용자 지정 헤더를 추가하며 Angular의 HTTP 클라이언트를 사용하여 파일 업로드/다운로드 기능을 구현하여 백엔드 API와의 원활한 상호 작용을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear nuevos servicios de API para la comunicación con el backend, agregando caché y encabezados personalizados, e implementando la carga y descarga de archivos utilizando el cliente HTTP de Angular, lo que permite una interacción fluida con las APIs de backend a través de protocolos HTTP.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer de nouveaux services d''API pour la communication backend, en ajoutant une mise en cache et des en-têtes personnalisés, et en mettant en œuvre la fonctionnalité de téléchargement et de téléchargement de fichiers à l''aide du client HTTP d''Angular, ce qui permet une interaction fluide avec les API de backend via les protocoles HTTP.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, neue API-Dienste für die Kommunikation mit dem Backend zu erstellen, indem Caching und benutzerdefinierte Header hinzugefügt und die Datei-Upload-/Download-Funktionality mithilfe des HTTP-Clients von Angular implementiert werden, was eine nahtlose Interaktion mit Backend-APIs über HTTP-Protokolle ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar novos serviços de API para comunicação de backend, adicionando cache e cabeçalhos personalizados e implementando upload/download de arquivos usando o Cliente HTTP do Angular, permitindo interação sem problemas com APIs de backend via protocolos HTTP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать новые службы API для взаимодействия с серверной частью, добавляя кэширование и настраиваемые заголовки, а также реализуя загрузку/выгрузку файлов с помощью клиента HTTP Angular, обеспечивая беспрепятственное взаимодействие с серверными API через протоколы HTTP.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء خدمات API جديدة للاتصال الخلفي، بإضافة التخزين المؤقت والرؤوس المخصصة وتنفيذ تحميل/تنزيل الملفات باستخدام عميل HTTP Angular، مما يسمح بالتفاعل دون مشاكل مع واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الخلفية عبر بروتوكولات HTTP."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new API services for backend communication","Adding caching to API calls for improved performance","Implementing file upload/download functionality"],"zh":["为后端通信创建新的 API 服务","为 API 调用添加缓存以提高性能","实现文件上传/下载功能"],"ja":["バックエンド通信用に新しい API サービスを作成する","API 呼び出しにキャッシュを追加してパフォーマンスを向上させる","ファイルのアップロード/ダウンロード機能を実装する"],"ko":["백엔드 통신용으로 새로운 API 서비스를 생성한다","API 호출에 캐싱을 추가하여 성능을 개선한다","파일 업로드/다운로드 기능을 구현한다"],"es":["Creación de nuevos servicios de API para la comunicación con el backend","Agregar caché a las llamadas de API para mejorar el rendimiento","Implementar la funcionalidad de carga y descarga de archivos"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux services d''API pour la communication backend","Ajout d''une mise en cache aux appels d''API pour améliorer les performances","Mise en œuvre de la fonctionnalité de téléchargement et de téléchargement de fichiers"],"de":["Erstellung neuer API-Dienste für die Kommunikation mit dem Backend","Hinzufügen von Caching zu API-Aufrufen für verbesserte Leistung","Implementierung der Datei-Upload-/Download-Funktionality"],"pt":["Criar novos serviços de API para comunicação de backend","Adicionar cache às chamadas de API para melhorar o desempenho","Implementar funcionalidade de upload/download de arquivos"],"ru":["Создание новых служб API для взаимодействия с серверной частью","Добавление кэширования к вызовам API для улучшения производительности","Реализация функциональности загрузки/выгрузки файлов"],"ar":["إنشاء خدمات API جديدة للاتصال الخلفي","إضافة التخزين المؤقت إلى مكالمات API لتحسين الأداء","تنفيذ وظيفة تحميل/تنزيل الملفات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Angular application setup","Limited to Angular framework","Backend API base URL required"],"zh":["需要 Angular 应用程序设置","仅限于 Angular 框架","需要后端 API 基础 URL"],"ja":["Angular アプリケーションの設定が必要","Angular フレームワークのみ","バックエンド API のベース URL が必要"],"ko":["Angular 애플리케이션 설정이 필요하다","Angular 프레임워크만 해당","백엔드 API 기본 URL가 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de aplicación de Angular","Limitado al marco de Angular","Se requiere la URL base de la API de backend"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''application Angular","Limité au framework Angular","L''URL de base de l''API de backend est requise"],"de":["Benötigt Angular-Anwendungseinrichtung","Begrenzt auf Angular-Framework","Backend-API-Grund-URL erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer configuração de aplicativo Angular","Limitado ao framework Angular","URL de base da API de backend necessário"],"ru":["Требуется настройка приложения Angular","Ограничен фреймворком Angular","Требуется базовый URL серверной API"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق Angular","محدود بإطار Angular","مطلوب URL قاعدة API الخلفية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"ceb624085444aceecc0680392171713e60ccc3647c7c6c11f6d684a0486b0c7e","qualityScore":57}');
